// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2858577778" "Took a few hits from the heroes.  Check the hull."
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2474233238" "It's pulling to the right a bit when I bank."
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2433263770" "If it was working optimally, I wouldn't be here now would I?"
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P92939153" "I don't know, it just started to sputter in mid-climb."
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1097584490" "Did you let a grunt fly this?  They always run ragged afterwards."
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3573753115" "I almost slammed into a building trying to bank right.  Gee, I'd say something's not working."
// SIRENSCALL_BEINGCHECKED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2900972494" "I hope the wreckage around here isn't from your repair handiwork."

// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3874209757" "Oh that was SUCH a mistake!  You won't live to tell about it, hero!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1810527656" "Dumb move, hero!  Reinforcements!  NOW!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2601720842" "I think I got enough juice in this thing to take you out, hero!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1505286611" "Systems check later.  Extreme pain and suffering of hero NOW."
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P358454378" "I'm gonna blast you into rubble!"
// SIRENSCALL_SKIFF_BEINGCHECKED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2673542668" "A hero ain't nuthin' but a sandwich!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4229256091" "I keep spotting heroes in the area.  Keep your eyes open."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P232644639" "You're getting behind, keep up."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2433960050" "Looks good from up here."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2430841852" "Man, Randall's Ruins looks trashed from here."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3893644297" "We'll make another pass, then head back."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2749932590" "Hey, wait up."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1070013260" "Heroes do not get through on THIS watch!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4221349933" "Get them!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1638037031" "Protect the base!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1980352083" "You should have stayed in Buildville, hero!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2942186319" "Hear that?  That's the sound of your doom!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_BASEAIRPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2798430520" "I'm going to blast you into next week!"

// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2698114537" "This is an expensive machine.  If I see you hot-dogging with it again, I'll ground you."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2694032753" "Just keep still while I run diagnostics."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P679752025" "Sheesh.  What did you do?  Fly through a hurricane?"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2421469651" "You were just in here yesterday.  You need to respect the equipment."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1484411990" "Next time, I'm going to let you pay for the repairs."
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3173311448" "You need to respect the machine, man!  Honestly!"

// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2774645314" "Maintenance later!  You got enough to take out the heroes!"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1313898202" "Diagnostics later!  Take them out!"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1424705984" "Heroes!  I hate heroes!"
// SIRENSCALL_CHASER_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4208972485" "I'm fine!  Go after the heroes!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2085558562" "Yeah, heroes are in the distance.  What about you?  Over."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2389306025" "Some skirmishes here and there, nothing to worry about.  Yet.  Over."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2302267668" "I'm relatively clear here.  You?  Over."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2500230148" "Looks clear here.  Over."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1389013950" "Do not let them get in the base!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4262356161" "You know what to do!  No hero gets past!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2301780823" "Get the heroes!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_DAY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2555982665" "This isn't a fight heroes can win."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2898356736" "Wow, kinda dark.  Even with the glow from the war walls."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P912497382" "I can't wait till I get switched back to days.  I hate graveyard shift."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1305679823" "Do you see anything up there?"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1970666191" "Did you hear something?"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1637055469" "What was that?"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3969894028" "No, you can't have the walkie talkie.  Just look.  Don't speak."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3005365698" "This is not a drill!  Take out the heroes!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3019564000" "You know what to do!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_GUARDBASE_NIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2830872619" "We got some heroes incoming!  Let's do it!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1959101165" "I asked for St. Martial.  I got Randall's Ruins.  How's that for being born under a bad sign?"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2468742802" "A few more loops of the base and then we'll call it a day."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1807755914" "I much prefer day shift.  You can see the heroes coming."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1294744406" "No, seriously, can we stop a sec? I have something in my boot."
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3680741083" "A few more loops and then let's take a break."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P248511426" "Let the games begin!  Heroes 0.  Villains 1.  The only score I'll accept!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P680049261" "Patrol later.  Fight now!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2442197882" "Let's do this, people!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALLSRUINS_PATROLBASE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P272176663" "If I see this hero survive, someone will get demoted!"

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1079943193" "You Tsoo REALLY need to learn your place!  Here, let me show you about respect!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3024283213" "I got a live one here, sir!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1969532154" "Nothing like a good old fashioned bar brawl!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P500769743" "Tsoo need to learn who's in charge here!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4048579803" "Didn't you get the memo, Tsoo?  Arachnos is top dog."

// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1471867428" "I'm easy!  Tsoo or heroes, it's all the same to me.  Now let's finish it!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3905303123" "Great, add some heroes to the mix.  I could use a workout!"
// SIRENSCALL_RANDALL_BARBRAWLOUT_FIGHTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1644239668" "Tsoo were too easy.  Heroes should be a little more interesting!"

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3390316449" "What a wasteland.  I hate patrolling here."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1370578627" "I'd rather be patrolling the base."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P231165128" "Mind the gap."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P274616780" "Hey, watch yourselves.  Lots of debris here."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1568905238" "Just keep your eyes open.  Never know what'll pop out at you."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1455682956" "I wanted the base.  I got Fossburg.  Nice.  Real nice."
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4023757821" "I'm bored."

// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3414235059" "Failure is not an option!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P886595441" "This is what you've been training for!  Get them!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1233204990" "Heroes have no place in Fossburg!"
// SIRENSCALL_FOSSBURG_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P266017291" "Stamp out the pestilence!"

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2046348452" "Let me see if I can spot weld your ears together."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2807899906" "This base is off limits to all non-Arachnos personnel!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1137265046" "You should not be here!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1608452377" "Welding can wait.  You need a refresher course in pain!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3082614931" "See the symbol on those pretty Arachnos flags?  Is there one on your body?  Then you are TRESPASSING!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1737340394" "Trespassing.  Look it up.  Nevermind, I'll just hurt some sense into you."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P527889661" "We must keep a tight ship around here."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2274105620" "Lord Recluse has high expectations and they must be met."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1830498177" "Base inspection could be at any moment."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4159438396" "Everything must be in pristine order."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3500195343" "Didn't I already weld this spot?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3161543357" "Ow...think I burnt my thumb."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WELDING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P244836577" "All the power Recluse has, you'd think he'd pony up some welding goggles..."

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1823857268" "Cage Consortium runs a tight ship."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1157835418" "We need to prepare for more shipments, the boats will be in soon."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2236573094" "They've been working on that ship for years."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1732344998" "Frankly, I think we should fill it and make a large swimming pool."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P726717914" "No, I don't think you're up for a promotion.  You insulted your commanding officer's wife.  You're lucky you're not shark bait."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2415168269" "Lesson learned, wouldn't you say?  You don't mess with the Fortunatas if you want to keep your teeth.  Did it slip your mind?"

// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2484237494" "You have underestimated us for the last time!"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2619165058" "This one has a death wish."
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2418782421" "Hey look!  Ballistic testing material!"
// SHARKHEAD_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P510635201" "It's gonna be a closed casket funeral for you, meat!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2454066516" "Well it's never really ever 'clear' is it?  But it's manageable.  Out."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3121491533" "We're fine here.  I'll let you know if things get exciting.  Out."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3030654436" "Reporting for guard duty.  Out."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P646538460" "I'll be moving our team over to the north side in about twenty minutes.  Over."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P978260162" "Forget reinforcements!  We got this!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P381718913" "You just made my shift!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_CATWALK_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1907830223" "You hungry?  How about a knuckle sandwich?"

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1097008854" "What is your purpose here?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4218479282" "This area is off-limits to non-Arachnos personnel."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1316484533" "Did you not read the 'NO TRESPASSING' sign?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4018176048" "You people never learn.  How many holes must I put in you before you start staying out of our area."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1527520632" "I'm getting tired of this pin-cushion.  Ten more minutes.  If he doesn't start singing like a canary, he's shark bait."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2998833423" "If I were you, I'd start talking."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1920679325" "I have a weapon pointed at a man's head and I'm in the middle of an interrogation.  Did it ever occur to you that MAYBE trotting past like an elephant could be considered an intrusion?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1882466838" "You I will deal with later.  Captain Intrusion here is now on my No Witnesses list."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P934145574" "Have you heard this one before?  A walking corpse stumbles in on an interrogation..."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1028584895" "Why are you doing this?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2701001152" "Let me go."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2094575075" "This is completely unfair!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2851746511" "I have nothing you want."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1215645666" "I can't tell you anything that will help you.  Just let me go!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2278310762" "Just tell me what you want to hear."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P526770466" "I just love hunting, don't you?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P510985780" "Run!  Run faster!  There is much sport in this!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P145000123" "RUN!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2519905553" "This is MUCH better than guard duty!  Keep up!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2598637033" "I like to let 'em run sometimes. Makes it more fun. For me."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1756771036" "Hey!  More prey!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1628210369" "Forget the wounded one.  This one will provide MUCH more sport!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P157122560" "Let's play run with the bulls.  You can be the red flag!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_CHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3588660351" "Think of this as a game of tag, except lose the 'fun' part and add grievous bodily harm and intense humiliation instead."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1223908009" "Get back to the Pit!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3214317070" "You know you're not supposed to be here!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P88530854" "Don't make things worse for yourself."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P30989994" "Sure it's a little unfair to chase a wounded man, but...well...so?"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2752005958" "You can run, but you can't hide, Scrapyarder!  I'm coming for you!"

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3038950656" "Ignore that one, we've got a new problem!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3747420616" "Forget that one!  We've got bigger fish to fry now!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P74781901" "Okay, this chase just got a bit more interesting!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_SCRAPYARDCHASER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P258857919" "Fresh meat!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P970303647" "This Shipment needs to be ready for inspection."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P368358537" "Stack everything over there."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1567819787" "This shipment is due in Cap au Diable next week."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1373338734" "I don't care if I told you to move it there, move it back over here."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1911831887" "Suck it up, man.  My little sister can carry these crates with less whining than you."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3023561203" "Forget the crate.  Hurt the trespasser."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2518285560" "Forget the shipment.  Make this one bleed."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2984075734" "Intruder!  The shipment can wait!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1280226508" "YES, you can put your box down now!  Take out the trespasser!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P752180168" "Things seem quiet.  We should meet our deadline."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3504584371" "This shipment hasn't yet been through Quality Control."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1691030019" "We've got everything ready, send down the checklist."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P938478703" "No, I have no idea what's in the crates.  I just want you to send someone over to inventory them.  That's your job, isn't it?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3713557397" "I have a walkie talkie.  You have a walkie talkie.  I say the shipment is ready.  You send someone over to check it.  It's really quite simple."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4014039297" "Well of course it's slightly damaged.  We got attacked by some meat and we dropped a few crates.  You'd prefer bullet holes to a few dents?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3344446013" "Is this your first day?  Give the walkie talkie to someone who knows what they're doing.  You're driving me nuts."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1085089422" "You know why Johnny Sonata sings that song, Charles?  Because you freakin' can't."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3777462873" "We have a sighting. Looks like one of Recluse's projects."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3753884834" "First order of business is to guard the supplies.  Eliminate the intruder then explain the crate damage."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1924800206" "This area is off limits!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2534126308" "This is a secure area!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARDSUPPLIES_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2378337434" "Recluse's pet or not, you're going down."

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2047258488" "If I see something exciting, I'll let you know."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1905747747" "This area is relatively secure."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4036757365" "I've got it under control.  I'll let you know if anything changes."
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1703413458" "Hey, tell command we want a break soon.  We're hungry."

// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P534836926" "We've got company!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1288287208" "Congratulations!  You've won a free trip to the hurt locker!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P297138413" "Incoming!"
// SHARKHEAD_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3268563910" "Now the action starts!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1207087490" "We'll make one more pass and then head back to  base."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1583213636" "Make a turn up ahead."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4161880771" "I have my eye on you."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2034714356" "Lord Recluse is watching you."

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P890872893" "What time is it?"
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2301612069" "We'll make one more pass then head back."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3862624187" "Keep up the pace, guys.  We're nearing the end of our watch."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3302996717" "You've been assigned the patrol of Villa Requin.  This is the best detail in Sharkhead.  Impress me with your gratitude."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1436557632" "We've got to keep things moving."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P868782391" "Lord Recluse is serious about timeliness."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1749620202" "Right.  Got it.  I'll let them know the orders."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P263496641" "Anything else before I break the connection?  Sure.  Got it.  Over and out."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P631037664" "Gotta go.  Something's up."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P125235021" "On the scale of big mistakes, 'chosen one,' coming here was SEISMIC."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_ORDERS_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3131145973" "Forget the orders...I need to put some serious hurt on this one."

// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2965870114" "Right... Left... Right... Left..."
// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P300534260" "Lift those knees higher, your form is sloppy!"
// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1490019497" "I don't want any pulled muscles.  Keep yourselves limber."
// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2063561508" "Four more...  No wait, five."

// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2982094375" "Warm ups are over.  Time for the real exercise!"
// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3256755776" "Feel free to spill blood, men!"
// SHARKHEAD_WARMUP_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1206252455" "Warm up is over.  Let's hit the ring!"

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3341059971" "Keep your eyes open.  Things are too quiet for my comfort."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2765841883" "Things are pretty quiet.  The calm before the storm, I'm sure.  Stay on your toes."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1918664669" "Ignore the small stuff.  We save our energy for the big fights."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3257637418" "Don't break formation unless the disturbance is worthy of our time.  I mean it."

// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2029288622" "Oh, you are so not walking out of here without pain."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3755559413" "I'm going to tear you to pieces!"
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2551668626" "You made a wrong turn, meat.  It WILL cost you."
// SHARKHEAD_ARACHNOS_WATCHTOWER_WALKIETALKIE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3131131302" "Here's that storm I was talking about!"

// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3711729544" "That's it.  A bit more to tighten up that spot ought to do it."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1335662229" "You'll need to reshape it a little.  Good.  There."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2382168417" "It needs to be very solid.  These joints have to be strong."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P535931103" "It's going to have to carry a large ship.  You can't afford to be hasty on the joints."
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2400777982" "Little more on the left and that should do it."

// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P156296188" "You'll not destroy the work we have done here!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P681814097" "This is a secure area!  You're not supposed to be here!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2972854852" "We have a breach of security over here!  Take care of it!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2989309647" "I don't care who you think you are.  Trespassers will be prosecuted!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2639664895" "How did you get in here?  This area is restricted!"
// OAKES_OILSPILL_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3042905259" "Probably a vandal!  Don't let anyone touch this!"

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_ARACHNOSFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3242707331" "A uniform is a uniform!  Makes no difference what side it's on.  You're going down!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_ARACHNOSFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3042593482" "This beach party just got more interesting."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBATTLE_ARACHNOSFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P610144739" "I hate heroes!"

// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1012761726" "No one gets past.  That's the order."
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3103504714" "Not this time, punk."
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3446979977" "I don't think so."
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4044317073" "The only way you're getting past is over my bloated corpse."
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1623864253" "One of us is stepping aside and it's not going to be me!"
// NERVA_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3457624783" "You should have just turned around and went back where you came from."

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1452442196" "Pockets of activity.  I'll let you know if it gets interesting.  Over."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P304729082" "Nothing major to report.  Over."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3798109207" "Beach is clear here.  Over."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2356275421" "I see water.  Lots of it.  I'll let you know when things get interesting."

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2530036366" "Things just got interesting!  Over!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2258354676" "We got company!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1907464151" "Don't run.  You'll only die tired!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P386648125" "The beach just got more crowded!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_BEACHBASEGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1984643000" "You crashed the wrong beach!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3722910118" "Wh-what do you want?  ID?  Here, take it."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1592245293" "Why am I being stopped?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P766425400" "What did I do?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P985492037" "Do I need to call my attorney?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1777388604" "Are you allowed to be doing this?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1827559994" "I'm out of here!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2918504317" "I'm calling my lawyer!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATEDNPC_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1006196585" "You detained the wrong person!  My brother is an attorney!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P530387400" "ID, please."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2077030931" "Stop talking.  Do the check on this one."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3384696805" "I'll have to ask you to remain still while we check your identification."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4239143846" "Stand still.  This'll only take a moment."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P370988700" "We'll get to you later.  This one is first!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1853766372" "Never mind him.  This is the one we want!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_CREDENTIALSCHECK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2838796527" "Forget him!  We got bigger fish to fry!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P532747600" "Crimson is an easy patrol.  Thorn Isle.  Now that is where things get interesting."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3705993463" "It's go time!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2356829664" "Well this is a pleasant surprise.  I thought patrols would be boring!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1306571735" "Finally!  Some action!"

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2307430768" "Just up ahead let's make a turn and head towards the water."
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P677021825" "Primeva's a better patrol assignment than Crimson Cove.  Don't you think?"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3209590018" "I hope someone jay-walks soon.  I'm bored."

// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3178375819" "Here we go!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P249993822" "Stick together!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2211143156" "This is it, people!  Not a drill!"
// NERVA_PRIMEVA_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2518530057" "New assignment!  Let's fight!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4153369042" "This section of Crimson is secure."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3338137952" "We're ok over here.  What about you guys?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2591480736" "Bits and pieces of activity.  Nothing major.  I'll let you know if something comes up."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2081013271" "I already told you.  When you're me, you can use the walkie talkie."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P203755072" "Guys.  Keep the channel quiet until something comes up.  You want to broadcast our presence to the world?"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3525492133" "Time to shine, men!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3560710670" "We got action.  Over and out!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3038807681" "Lower your weapons!  First!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2552229786" "I must look stupid if you think I'm going to lower my weapon because you told me to."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3508508332" "That's not the way it works.  You lower your weapons and THEN we lower ours."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1586195850" "Looks like we have us a stand off."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3866501292" "All bets are off!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3405097675" "That's it!  Let's do this!"

// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1277281202" "I wasn't born yesterday.  We lower them together."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3659022130" "Look, someone is going to get hurt here."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P821032066" "Council does not stand down to anyone."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1108118712" "I'm not lowering anything.  Talk with weapons up until we sort this out."
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3665104349" "Forgive me my rudeness, but I don't trust you."

// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P686286388" "Where did they come from?"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1683880955" "Pick a target, people!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3858161755" "Free for all!"
// NERVA_CRIMSON_STANDDOWN_COUNCIL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3310842513" "All bets are off!  Fire!"

// CAP_LONEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P683890387" "Okay... hold it together, man."
// CAP_LONEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2112224297" "Lord Recluse is watching YOU, citizen!"
// CAP_LONEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4151473403" "Behave, and no one gets hurt."
// CAP_LONEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2433287666" "Act properly, and there will be no trouble."
// CAP_LONEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P623537022" "I wish I had reinforcements."

// CAP_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4288243127" "Unauthorized entry!"
// CAP_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1035525140" "Intruder alert!"
// CAP_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P688963344" "Now you've done it!"
// CAP_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P933237229" "You are denied access!"
// CAP_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2367083284" "Lines have been crossed."
// CAP_DOORGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4094380597" "My orders are clear! You will pay!"

// CAP_LONEPATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3871127737" "Okay... Remember your training!"
// CAP_LONEPATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3872244573" "I don't need any help to take you down!"

// CAP_AEON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1133790342" "Watch those malingerers.  They break the law, then they are ours!"
// CAP_AEON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3963508139" "Gold Brickers are on the watchlist. Bust them if they make a mistake."
// CAP_AEON_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1803806128" "Those Luddite protesters are on the watchlist. Feel free to take them down if they make a misstep."

// CAP_AEON_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1560046919" "If you get captured, you do not say one word!"

// CAP_NH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4215313272" "This neighborhood is on the decline, I tell you."
// CAP_NH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P130217802" "Even without those pipes running through it, this place is starting to attract a bad element."
// CAP_NH_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P625300275" "I miss the orange pipes.  They offer a strange comfort."


// CAP_MD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2152676710" "Dr. Aeon has entrusted us with watching the PTS. I, for one, would not like to let him down."
// CAP_MD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P76504654" "Those pipes are painted Safety Orange for a reason. Don't get too close to them."
// CAP_MD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2821877041" "All of the PTS equipment here is worth more than your skin, so be careful."
// CAP_MD_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3969210066" "<em t=3>We are under orders to not engage the Clockwork here.  <em t=3> Dr. Aeon wants to see what they're up to. Call it a science experiment."

// CAP_MD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2449128999" "Heads Up! Incoming!"
// CAP_MD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1926406298" "Check your fire near the pipes!"
// CAP_MD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1857993264" "We cannot allow them to get near the PTS junctions!"
// CAP_MD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3761663470" "Form up and take them down!"
// CAP_MD_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3932834605" "The PTS must be defended!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3817469985" "I'm not moving!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3563826164" "This isn't over."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4268993842" "I can bide my time..."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1124708789" "When this is over...watch your back."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P252030774" "You're really making a mistake here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2429336929" "I can't believe you're doing this."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P279367504" "Saved by an interruption!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1043953018" "Sleep with one eye open."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1945041976" "I will see you very soon!  But first, I'll deal with this."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1194216113" "This is not Paragon City, punk.  You have NO rights here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2272519885" "Don't move and maybe I'll let you keep your head."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1248136878" "Rule number one:  you have no rights."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3282343533" "Don't move."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P21425612" "One word and you become a distant memory."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1024459576" "So we meet again."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P755985361" "Show them who rules these islands!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2118496960" "I don't think you quite understand the influence of Lord Recluse.  Let me show you!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1775633692" "You must have a death wish."

// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2131685785" "Yeah, we got more.  They never learn."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1113331289" "Sure.  I'll bring them over in a minute."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2542771849" "Can we 'interrogate' them before we drop them off?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P641097022" "Right.  I'm on it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P124539715" "Oh, I don't think they're going anywhere."
// MERCY_DARWIN_APPREHEND_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P566749662" "Yeah, they think they're 'destined'.  Destined for trial by fire."

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1721724722" "Welcome to Darwin's Landing.  Tell me everything I want to know."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3924661017" "You must be new here.  Don't move or I'll blow your head off."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2745632933" "There are ways of making people talk.  And then there are WAYS."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1340573436" "I have plenty of time to play.  Let's get that straight right away."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1884283103" "You thought you were important.  This is the real test.  You're nothing yet."

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1090318748" "More meat has arrived at the Landing!  Let's educate them!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P346694622" "You need to learn some respect!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2049192714" "Can you believe I just got attacked by some meat?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P879375728" "Some more 'destined' ones!  Ha!  Not 'til they prove themselves!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1503545031" "I don't know what to tell you.  Just tell me what you want!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3464735072" "I don't know what you're looking for."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1547468239" "Just...just let me go."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2725163139" "I'm sure we can work this out."
// MERCY_DARWIN_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3992508673" "No need for weapons, let's work this out."

// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2016306592" "This is Mercy, but you'll get none from us."
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4121273221" "You'll get no mercy from me."
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1417879491" "We can do this the easy way.  Or we can do this the hard way.  Let's just do it the hard way."

// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1510128749" "More meat has arrived in Mercy!  Let the lessons begin!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2583916980" "Instruction begins!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3271560674" "Let me teach you the rules of the Rogue Isles!"
// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3954602761" "Hey, look it's another reject from the Zig!  Prove your worth!"

// MERCY_MERCY_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1484131772" "No need for violence, let's work this out."

// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3184195043" "See those peons down in Mercy and Darwin?  They got it easy.  You should know better."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2451268616" "Easy.  Hard.  Easy.  Hard.  Hard way it is!"
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3585978756" "There are two reasons you're on the receiving end of this weapon:  we're bigger and better."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1110547997" "My respect for you dwindles by the minute."

// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P944183599" "I really do hate being interrupted!"
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P370316721" "More the merrier, I say.  Let's go!"
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P210973845" "You walk in on me while I'm working? You must want some pain."

// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P742249527" "This isn't the end.  Be sure of that."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3449619154" "This is temporary."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1241185979" "Enjoy your success.  It's temporary."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P592207903" "Didn't you ever learn that heroes always win in the end?"

// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1972208980" "This isn't the end, scum.  Be sure of that."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P800938818" "You'll get nothing outta me."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3284196414" "Enjoy your success while you can. The tables will turn."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P814319150" "Don't get cocky."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_VICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P103455221" "How about we settle this now - just you and me."

// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2807669671" "You're in for a world of hurt."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1301370187" "Keep quiet. This will be over soon."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2825389602" "This will teach you to interfere."
// MERCY_FORT_CAUGHT_FC_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3484376257" "You're a long way from Paragon City."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3120432230" "Let's go!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P613086693" "Right now!  Let's do this!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P712855217" "Your luck has run out!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2195676764" "Destined one, eh?  You gotta earn it, pal!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2119898671" "You need to make your mark, pal!  You haven't yet.  No respect here!"

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3397478937" "We got it covered.  Over."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P590039738" "Sure, we got fights here and there.  If they get important, we'll jump in."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P174252008" "How's it look where you are?"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1117822788" "I'm good over here.  Skirmishes.  Not worth my time yet."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4070371023" "One second, I need to do something here.  You!  Keep moving!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P513940786" "One sec.  I'm watching you!   Okay, I'm back."

// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P414422732" "Gotta go!  Action just started!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2258064019" "Can't talk.  Must fight!"
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2092777364" "This watch just got a lot more interesting."
// MERCY_ALLHOODS_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2817159804" "And...we fight."

// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2405284760" "Did you see the dregs the plane dropped off earlier?"
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P698910118" "Every day a new batch of Zig rejects.  I wonder why we bother breaking them out?"
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3821902531" "Poor batch of Zig rejects today."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3834504007" "We have our work cut out for us on this new batch of Zig meat."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3161246398" "Did you see the meat coming off the Zig copters?  Eesh."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4142343865" "We do what we always do.  Throw them in the ring and see who survives."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3843323972" "Survival of the fittest.  If they can't take it here, they'll never make it in the Isles."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2037859529" "They gotta prove themselves to Lord Recluse.  Until then, they're just meat to us."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2555870841" "Until they prove their worth, we take 'em down.  Every time."

// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2499419950" "Was I talking to you?"
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1414830927" "You have eavesdropped on a private discussion.  That was a mistake."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3500370945" "You must think you're someone pretty special to be walking in on a private chat.  Let me re-educate you."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P101840937" "What are you doing?"
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P205275235" "Only shark bait eavesdrops on a private discussion."
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1841419607" "Hey, time to make your mark, meat!"
// MERCY_GENERIC_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P996884213" "Time to prove your worth, meat!"

// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2933765008" "Lot of Skull activity here.  We need to take care of this."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2616747141" "I'm right with you.  Let's head up that bend, there."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P593273957" "A few more trips around Mercy and then let's head down to Darwin.  I want to harass some meat."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1340181070" "Easy there.  I'm right here."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P397391472" "You!  Keep in line."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2421310487" "I'm watching you."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1721219405" "Until they prove themselves, they're meat.  Take them out."

// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1815413478" "Time to earn some respect!"
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1702539947" "You test my patience, meat!"
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3536246094" "No mercy from this patrol!"
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3505936889" "We have some issues to deal with here."
// MERCY_MERCY_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P413197939" "Let's see if you have what it takes to be on the Recluse team!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2817733593" "Just look at them all.  Dregs from the Zig."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3211219169" "I don't think we can use any of them.  I hate this post."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P81696061" "Maintain a strong presence here.  Let them know Lord Recluse is in charge."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2537288469" "See the Landing?  Look what the cat dragged in."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P33081359" "Yeah, they have no idea what they're in for.  They think they're 'destined'.  Gotta prove themselves first."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P668588012" "I'm watching you.  And you."

// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3222822064" "Time to enforce our reputation."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2252265630" "Don't let them get away with anything.  One slips through the cracks and it's anarchy."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P230168152" "Show them who is in control here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2112140395" "Now's the time to prove your worth to Recluse, meat!"

// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2574816338" "We provide the presence.  Make it a strong one."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3247261035" "Men, move along this road then head up to the north."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3550562245" "Did you see the wretches down in Mercy and Darwin's Landing?  Peons."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2351491338" "I would love to be in the Fortunata patrol."

// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3106516057" "Just ignore them.  They can't do anything here."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1627707862" "Yeah, I see them.  Ignore them.  Let's go."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2204859974" "You there!  Recluse is watching you!"
// MERCY_FORT_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3157367392" "You!  I have my eye on you, meat."

// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2776174498" "We can use this..."
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1920872594" "Hm...interesting."
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1578247752" "I'm sure the Council won't miss one or two Mech Men."
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2725906442" "I can do a lot with this Mech Man."

// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1330900903" "Ignore that one.  <em face=a t=2> No consequence."
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1857032887" "Just meat.  Keep working."
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P659602029" "<em=none>Keep moving, meat.  <em=CrossArms face=a t=2>This is Arachnos business."
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3920885836" "<em point f=a>You're interfering.  I'm too busy to deal with you now, but you are in my book.<em CrossArms>"
// MERCY_FORT_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3797176615" "You.  I'll deal with you later."

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1645800184" "You are an infection.  Prepare to be treated!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2437400956" "Take them down before they infect others."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2051741090" "You're going to be eliminated."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421355091" "You're going down."

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P433312560" "More to the party!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2915539365" "We got stragglers!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2512767978" "Get them, too!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1809581769" "I just spotted some more meat.  Let's take them out, too!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT_TEXT :
"P693143301" "Hey, get them, too!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2909728027" "Hellions.  I hate Hellions."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1573027045" "This isn't Paragon City, pal.  Lord Recluse OWNS these islands!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P890167642" "You need to learn your place, Hellion!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2606242965" "We can do both!  Let's go!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3885534874" "More meat for the fire!"

// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1071089232" "You Skulls are as sorry as the Hellions.  Should have stayed in Perez, meat."
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1960797136" "Let me drum a tune on your bones."
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3661690692" "You Skulls need to be taken down a few pegs.  I'll be the hammer."

// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3861435140" "Skulls and meat.  Why not?"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3932233597" "Grab that meat, too!  Let them see who rules Mercy Island!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3959009608" "They...just...don't...learn."
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4045455085" "You haven't proven anything to Recluse.  You're mine for the picking!"

// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2692991234" "Grab that meat, too!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1438758202" "This is our turf!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P237555391" "You're mine for the picking!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P225127593" "Your turn!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3697309468" "I hate Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3516676227" "I really hate Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3814002859" "Snakes.  I hate Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1496620178" "You should have stayed in your hole, Snakes!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1782044627" "Let this be a lesson to you!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1743887046" "We need to thin your numbers, Snakes."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1515593264" "You're gonna learn about loss."

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3099685472" "Teach them to stay out of Arachnos business!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT_TEXT :
"P259051859" "Let's show these guys who's in charge of Mercy Island."

// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P197565472" "This is not Paragon City.  Will...you...never...learn?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2168370159" "What should we do with this guy?  Make an example of him?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3187023687" "Welcome to Mercy.  Enjoying your stay so far?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3291461212" "Okay.  Rule number one.  Arachnos is the law.  Learn it.  Live it."

// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3658648886" "You got a problem?"
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3761694407" "I think we have another student here.  Let's educate them about the law of Arachnos."
// MERCY_DARWIN_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P975474109" "Let's welcome this one, too!  Get 'em!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1289016974" "You're mean!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4222882544" "This wasn't on the brochure!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P970967075" "I don't know what you guys want!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P913315743" "Leave me alone!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P113601739" "This is assault!"

// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P126293167" "You're in an Arachnos-controlled area.  That's a mistake."
// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2794630477" "Welcome to the Fort.  How are you enjoying your stay so far?"
// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3171927357" "Pushing these guys around is MUCH more fun than walking patrols."
// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4080889751" "See this one?  Peon.  That last guy was a lot more fun to push around.  He actually fought back."

// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2594216593" "Ah!  Company has arrived.  Let's give them a warm welcome!"
// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2369002511" "You want some?  Let's go!"
// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3872549862" "More meat!  Let's give them an Arachnos welcome."
// MERCY_FORT_SHOVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P142478293" "Grr, interrupted."

// MERCY_FORT_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3632379697" "I took a wrong turn.  I wasn't doing anything."
// MERCY_FORT_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3558519661" "I didn't see anything.  I swear!"
// MERCY_FORT_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1244276805" "You'll never get away with this!"
// MERCY_FORT_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P70572855" "Ow, that's my sore shoulder!"
// MERCY_FORT_NPCSHOVED_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4074134303" "Hey, easy!"

// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1109355277" "Good shot.  Keep it up."
// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2803789484" "Make adjustments for wind and distance on those targets."
// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2215402589" "Slow down.  Those targets aren't going anywhere."
// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3197006039" "Speed round coming up.  It'll be for points."
// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3810792160" "When you run out of ammo, switch up.  Let the next guy go."

// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1097302742" "Forget them.  If they get too close to the targets, it's not our fault if they get shot."
// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1820735832" "Ignore the meat.  Keep shooting."
// MERCY_FORT_TARGETPRACTICE_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3503228012" "Yeah, I see the intruder.  Just keep shooting for now.  We'll deal with the interference later."

// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2501434625" "You should be able to have that weapon cleaned and re-assembled in under two minutes."
// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1793592796" "Keep it clean."
// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3441510513" "I shouldn't even see a fingerprint on that weapon."

// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1699451709" "Here's your timed test.  Begin!"
// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P896810670" "You took a WRONG turn!"
// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3360561177" "Oh, you are so in the wrong place, meat."
// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P873118110" "Let's go, guys!"
// MERCY_WEAPONCHECK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3686990460" "Switching to target practice.  NOW."

// MERCY_FORT_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P788695986" "One or two more fixes should about do it."
// MERCY_FORT_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2195554161" "Good thing I checked this spot.  It was a bit weak."
// MERCY_FORT_WELDING_OVERSEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1835402847" "Hm...that's not good."

// MERCY_FORT_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2553133118" "Just keep working.  I see 'em, too."
// MERCY_FORT_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4091429925" "What the..?  Whatever.  This needs to get done."
// MERCY_FORT_WELDING_OVERSEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P954887768" "I'm ignoring you.  For now.  Watch your back."

// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1292962553" "Just move it over there."
// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2599236699" "We'll need to move them again anyway.  Just put it over there."
// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2245402644" "Easy with that.  It's worth more than you are."
// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P569555012" "If I'm missing one item from one crate, someone gets a demotion."

// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P421111864" "How did they get in here?  Protect the crates!"
// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4129866202" "Some nerve!"
// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P4060638080" "What nerve!"
// MERCY_FORT_CRATEMOVE_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2916829348" "Brave.  Very brave.  But stupid.  Very stupid."

// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3384673391" "This is how I want you to look at training.  If you fail, you die. Simple, huh?"
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1530792482" "Failure is not an option."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3096673055" "There is only one chance to make a first impression.  Make it unforgettable."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P917386116" "Your success and failure reflects directly upon Lord Recluse.  Think about that."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2710699725" "100% is not good enough."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3683498142" "If you fail me, you'll be more sorry than you can imagine."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2258516404" "When I tell you to move, you'll move.  When I tell you to jump, you're gonna say, 'How high?'."

// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1597764943" "You just made my list.  You don't want to be on my list!  Men, keep training."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1069755087" "Ignore them.  Keep training."
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1868714390" "You again?"
// MERCY_FORT_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3657271000" "Oh it's you."

// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3431655176" "Stay in formation!"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2157317151" "Not so sloppy!"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2708152336" "You move when I say you move!  Not before!"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2534645038" "You only need to be able to count to four.  Is that too much to ask?"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1666705666" "And...AGAIN!"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1705343548" "I can do this all day.  We don't stop until this is perfect!"

// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2729038241" "Keep going!  Ignore the intruder."
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2132932957" "Put your aggression for the intruder into your maneuvers!"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1338459141" "Keep training.  You must forget about interruptions.  Even meat!  Don't stop!"
// MERCY_FORT_DRILLYELL_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P1654092800" "I see them.  Don't stop training."

// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P490745005" "You...guys...never...know...when...to...QUIT!"
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P982987630" "I hate you guys!"
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P421548670" "You got nerve, but I have numbers."
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P295094819" "Man, I hate you guys!"
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P519731728" "Get it in your head!  You don't belong here!"
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3757438092" "I will keep taking you down until you figure out that you...can't...win."

// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2022130819" "More flames for the fire.  Bring it on."
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3733153978" "Friends of yours?  Hope they like pain!"
// MERCY_FORT_RUMBLEFREEDOM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1769934235" "More?  Sure.  I can beat you guys up, too."

// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2859825238" "Just let them fight.  Best to let them exterminate each other rather than make us do it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3813489929" "Those guys are spooky.  I'd hate to get touched by one of them."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P721883332" "Huh...some crowd tonight."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P14883929" "We break this up at dawn."

// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1832379258" "Oh, you wanna join the battle?  Great, let's go!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P933151306" "New contestant!  Right here!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1086396930" "Free admission to all meat fresh out of the Zig!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2357621966" "Another contestant!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3605647529" "Today's lesson:  pain.  Lots of it."
// MERCY_DARWIN_BATTLEDOME_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P633347061" "Now is the time to prove your worth to Lord Recluse, meat!"

// MERCY_FORT_FORTUNATAPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3752870932" "Ladies, a lovely day for a patrol around our Mistress's tower, is it not?"
// MERCY_FORT_FORTUNATAPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3687090288" "It is an honor to walk the grounds of our Mistress's Tower."
// MERCY_FORT_FORTUNATAPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3413278678" "Keep up, ladies.  We would not want to displease our mistress as we patrol her tower."

// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1693082360" "Why can't we patrol with the Fortunatas?"
// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P643731151" "I can't even get a patrol close to her tower."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4066363072" "Right behind you."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3961312592" "It's kind of quiet here.  Except for the meat stumbling around."

// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1363483989" "Keep walking.  I'm watching you, meat."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_ALERT_TEXT :
"P145075896" "Ignore the meat.  We have our orders."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1858420347" "Stand down.  Let it go.  I'll remember that face for later."
// MERCY_FORT_PATROLWOLF_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2254319582" "You.  Yes, you.  I see you.  Keep moving.  We'll meet up later, I'm sure."

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3610764175" "Well, I can see why Ghost Widow's tower is here.  It's a ghost TOWN."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3542080943" "Nothing exciting on this end.  And I mean that."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1362690010" "I feel like we're just for show.  I want to crack some skulls."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3678227946" "No, there is nothing at ALL going on here.  Over."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P954736089" "Hey, how's your watch going?  We're bored stiff over here."

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3304352149" "I got my eye on you, meat.  Keep moving."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4141787597" "You ain't destined yet, meat.  Keep moving."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2258806387" "Lord Recluse is watching you.  All...the...time."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_WOLFSPIDERS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1493272128" "Can't I just hit 'em?  Just one little hit?"

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARDFORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2870813143" "Mm.  Yes, I see them across the way."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARDFORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1023263750" "Ladies, keep an ever vigilant watch.  We would do well not to displease our mistress."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARDFORTUNATA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3492157021" "The tower is our responsibility, ladies.  It is our honor and duty to keep it secure."

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARDFORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2921852317" "Mm.  Yes, I see them, as well.  Carry on."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARDFORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3992968339" "You would do well to be on your way, little one."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARDFORTUNATA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P764412443" "Ladies, you are above acknowledging the presence of such an underling.  Carry on."

// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1318824527" "Hm...interesting.  I'm sure we can use this data somehow."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3122448339" "What kind of numbers did you get on that scan?  I'll check my database."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4146493112" "I'm getting some interesting numbers on that scan."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2352977115" "Oh, the things we can do to this machine to make it ours."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1806432512" "I see great things ahead for modifications."

// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1752373216" "Yes.  I see IT skulking past.  Not to worry.  Lord Recluse always finds a way to punish the curious."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1478031867" "Your days are numbered.  Look on curiously while you can."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1020437002" "Unless you please Lord Recluse, your curiosity will get you killed."
// MERCY_FORT_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3549871417" "Sigh.  Another thrill seeker looking to gain access to our secrets.  Ignore and continue.  We'll deal with it later."

// MERCY_CERBERUS_WELDING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2941196869" "How did you get in here?"
// MERCY_CERBERUS_WELDING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2664595472" "This Fort is restricted access!"
// MERCY_CERBERUS_WELDING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4013158661" "You just made a big mistake!  Big!"

// MERCY_CERBERUS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1904671543" "Breach!"
// MERCY_CERBERUS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2130423979" "I just spotted an intruder!"
// MERCY_CERBERUS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1962854485" "You just broke into an ARACHNOS FORT!  Are you insane?"

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P989655828" "Man, the sky and ground are littered with Longbow troops."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2333943206" "Those Freedom Corps do-gooders never learn."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2530870531" "They'll never get in here.  Never.  Pfft.  Longbow."

// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2844807588" "Lots of activity out there..."
// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1959838296" "Fort Darwin is crawling with Longbow."
// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2148374978" "When will they learn? They can't get to us."

// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD1_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3064861095" "Don't start something with me, I've got enough problems with those Longbow punks."


// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD1_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3337422237" "Give me a reason to beat you down, c'mon."

// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2829479728" "I remember when we still had Darwin."
// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1292550826" "I dare them to come up here. We'll take them all down."
// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P84737383" "They barely have Mercy, while we've got Galaxy. Punks."

// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD2_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3233102024" "I got strict orders not to fight you, but feel free to start something. I'm itching for some action.!"
// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD2_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2274615610" "Go ahead, make a move. I want you to."

// MERCY_CITY_NEW_GUARD3_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1661892884" "Try it, punk. I dare you."

// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3407450176" "You have all been chosen by Arbiter Richard to serve Arachnos. Now is the time to prove yourselves!"
// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3337568701" "Your lives are now forfeit. You serve the will of Lord Recluse now, never forget that!"
// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P905167728" "You have been chosen to push back to the threat of Longbow and to preserve the will of Arachnos."

// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1744531748" "We will make those Longbow fear Arachnos!"
// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P817645048" "You must make Longbow regret ever daring to invade the Rogue Isles!"
// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2422149366" "We are the frontline. We will not let them spread their so-called 'democracy' into our city!"
// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1883809683" "Do not retreat! Do not show fear!"
// MERCY_CITY_INSTRUCTOR2_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1360428614" "You must prepare yourselves to die in the name of Arachnos!"

// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4258342782" "How did YOU get in here?"
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3204479955" "You're in the WRONG place at the WRONG time."
// MERCY_FORTCERBERUS_GUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P356656110" "Do you have a death wish?  Let me grant it!"

// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_ACTIVE :
"P4164475388" "Oh boy, this is a no-win situation."
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_ACTIVE :
"P3842430549" "There aren't enough reinforcements in the world to get us through this."
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_ACTIVE :
"P727110524" "Oh, this going to suck."
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_ACTIVE :
"P4291962992" "We are so absolutely doomed!"

// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_INACTIVE :
"P1938647755" "Oh man!  What were they thinking?  We are so outclassed!"
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_INACTIVE :
"P1177500524" "Taking on some rebel scum was supposed to be easy.  No one said they were Marshall Blitz's Warburg garrison."
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_INACTIVE :
"P188125904" "Dang.  We need more of the big boys to back us up."
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_INACTIVE :
"P1938290041" "Oh man, this is going to be a bloodbath.  And we are going to be on the wrong side of it."
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_INACTIVE :
"P2214187375" "Just keep firing rounds in the direction of the Rogue elements.  Maybe they'll think there's more of us!"
// WARBURG_INVADER_FRONTLINE_INACTIVE :
"P4187759662" "They look like us, they know all our tactics... Heck, they WERE us until a few weeks ago.  This is going to be ugly!"

// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3352646657" "These are a bunch of rookies!  How are we supposed to quell a rebellious Arachnos faction with this lot?"
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P464113029" "Recluse says take down the rogue faction here, but he sends us out with this bunch of lightweights!"
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2300454997" "Oh man, we're going to baby-sit a slaughter here!  Blitz's boys are going to eat these children for breakfast."
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1359925048" "At least if I went rogue I wouldn't have to wipe these greenhorns' noses. Say, maybe that's not such a bad idea..."
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2799541662" "Slopppy, sloppy, sloppy!  You call this bunch an invasion force?"
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1556617" "They may look like us, but they have turned against Reculse. For that they must die."
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3607109874" "Reinforcements?  We need the entire 6th division to stand a chance out here!"

// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P23314235" "Great. Just Great.  Today was not bad enough."
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2566387807" "Perfect, just perfect."
// WARBURG_VB_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P3503713282" "I need this like I need some more rookies to baby-sit."

// WARBURG_VILLAINBASE_INSPECTION_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4002780548" "Whatever.  Things look fine.  Considering."
// WARBURG_VILLAINBASE_INSPECTION_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1098004470" "Like a lot of good this'll do us."
// WARBURG_VILLAINBASE_INSPECTION_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2216613025" "We're just walking to our doom.  I can feel it."

// WARBURG_VILLAINBASE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1131488998" "We're gonna dieeeee!"
// WARBURG_VILLAINBASE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2953319187" "This can only end badly!"
// WARBURG_VILLAINBASE_INSPECTION_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1676107325" "I knew this would happen!"

// WARBURG_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1421646372" "This is suicide."
// WARBURG_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3730074034" "You call this an invasion force? We are so utterly doomed."
// WARBURG_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1560913758" "We need like two hundred of those big fellas to even have a prayer of quelling this rebellion."
// WARBURG_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P458230061" "Marshal Blitz apparently grew dissatisfied with Recluse's reluctance to use the weapons housed on this island.  So he went rogue.  <em t=4> And we get to fall on the battlefield as a result.  Great."
// WARBURG_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P559585657" "If I was going to go rogue and split from Lord Recluse, I'd want to have the troops based in Warburg on my side."
// WARBURG_WATCHER_LOOKOUT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1251754805" "See those Longfangs arguing back there?  Now imagine a thousand of those big boys coming over the hill and you get a glimpse of our future."



// WARBURG_INVADER_HOSPITAL_INACTIVE :
"P4159430442" "'Guard the hospital.  It'll be cake.' What a joke.  You seen what firepower awaits us out there?!?"
// WARBURG_INVADER_HOSPITAL_INACTIVE :
"P2273281202" "Keep firing and maybe those guys'll think we are a proper invasion force."
// WARBURG_INVADER_HOSPITAL_INACTIVE :
"P1231690658" "Stick close to the Drones and you might make it. Emphasis on Might."
// WARBURG_INVADER_HOSPITAL_INACTIVE :
"P2771740949" "This is madness."
// WARBURG_INVADER_HOSPITAL_INACTIVE :
"P780347390" "This is insane.  The Rogue Arachnos here have us so totally outnumbered.  Outclassed, too!"

// WARBURG_WELD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2015122331" "What a freakin' rush job these turrets are. I doubt anyone thought this little invasion through."
// WARBURG_WELD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4249453437" "I double bonded this turret, for all the good it will do.  Doubt it'll last through the first wave."
// WARBURG_WELD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3804494813" "This is the sloppiest invasion I have ever seen. Recluse really misjudged the caliber of the rebels here."
// WARBURG_WELD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2438907107" "This isn't an invasion so much as a funeral."

// WARBURG_WELD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2563723503" "Dang, incoming!"
// WARBURG_WELD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3548035372" "C'mon, little turret, do your thing!"
// WARBURG_WELD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2561409905" "Well, this was a terrible plan."

// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1947058343" "Yeah, I see those Longbow circling down there.  We'll haul them in for a beating if they annoy us too much."
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3189091960" "Let's grab a few Longbow and 'interrogate' them."
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4123151430" "Some nerve they have down there, don't you think?  They're like fish in a barrel and still they try to get in."
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P320715537" "Did you see some Longbow sneaking around the alleys in Darwin's?  I have two words for that:  in sane"
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1151864568" "They can't get up here, and even if they do, they don't have enough numbers to make a dent."
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1543598713" "Yeah, I wouldn't get too close to Ghost Widow's tower if I were you.  I think she re-programmed the guard drone.  All I'm gonna say."
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3075789190" "How about those Rippers, eh?  They do our grunt work."

// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1737360230" "Whoa!  Looks like the Longbow aren't the only ones looking for a beating!"
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1140895261" "Oh, I don't think so!"
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P580368841" "You got some nerve breaching this tower!  Let me see if I can inflict some pain on that nerve."
// MERCY_FORT_LOITER_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2325278109" "Looks like it's time for some maneuvers!"

// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3123243038" "Those last guys?  I had no faith in them.  But you... You're special."
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3895706830" "The last five Squads I've had under my command...well... I have a really good feeling about you lot, though!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3822570670" "Sure they are an overwhelming force, but you guys have... uhh... heart!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1962305574" "You knew this was a rough job when you signed on.  Buck up, soldier!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3381184156" "Our arrival in Warburg was not so smooth.  It can only get better."
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P631737762" "Rogue Arachnos.  Think about those words. They have betrayed all that we fight for!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2600874274" "This invasion has been pretty sloppy so far.  This is Situation Normal, frankly."
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4097260515" "You've heard the rumors about the rogues hiring Matla mercenaries. Don't believe them! They've got to be false. Got to be."
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2860580433" "If you see a huge robot in there, keep your wits about you!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P608663460" "Before we run into the hot zone, everybody check to see that your buddy is here and accounted for."

// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4288470995" "Keep your wits about you!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2308991221" "Remember your training!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P479705110" "Stick close to the drones."
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1474216428" "Keep close to your foxhole buddy!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2151843096" "You move when I say Move, not before!"

// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1911148717" "Did he say something about Malta robots?"
// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P10784170" "Situation Normal, yessiree."
// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2982125203" "Robots?"
// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3594084793" "I have a bad, bad feeling about this."

// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3005210840" "Find cover!"
// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1224639879" "You want the Sarge, not me."
// WARBURG_RANKED_SOLDIER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1094212372" "Form up!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3599527689" "I don't care how tired your arms are.  This clipboard says that needs to move."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3443408452" "Wait.  I lost my place.  Oh, here we are.  Yeah, move it over there."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2261053902" "What?  How many did you say we had?  These numbers are off."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P145040389" "Easy with the merchandise, pal.  A broken toe will be the least of your worries."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P341586500" "Don't dr--  Oh fine, just fight the intruder!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P825415350" "You made me lose my place.  You're going down!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2008946891" "Hey, I got a box for you.  It's long and lined with silk!"

// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P12151403" "When you get to the hospital, say 'hi' for me."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2796124088" "And now it's time for live organ donation..."
// SHARKHEAD_ALLHOODS_DUOGUARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1548693969" "You know...they're just gonna write 'idiot' on the toe tag."

// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P792417228" "Plaid and overalls.  Does it GET any worse?  I have to beat some style into you."
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2404571783" "You've been stinking up Sharkhead for FAR too long."
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P962645387" "Everything about you Scrapyarders offends me."
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P978088069" "There's something about you that just rubs me wrong.  I'll beat it out of you!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1953685537" "Dang.  You sure did put the UG in 'ugly', didn't you?"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3808092693" "I like your outfit.  It screams 'hit me.'"

// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1709242849" "Hey, I have no problem with you on too, meat!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P466853970" "You too?  More to the party, I say!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1343613805" "More meat for the grinder!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3432442913" "I don't like you either!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P691907519" "There's other ways to get in the papers besides the obits, you know."
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3639494394" "You're just another notch on my resume, Scrapyarder!"

// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P73434560" "Come and get it, insect."
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P346011138" "Let's do this, poser!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P711672029" "I'll make scrap metal of you!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1232468664" "Oh, did I get a bit of grease on that slick outfit?  So sorry!"

// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1597151810" "Watch out!  Some 'spiderlings' just showed up!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2972357981" "Figures, you'd jump in on a battle in progress!  Weak!"
// SHARKHEAD_FIGHTSCRAPYARDERS_GANGS_SCRAP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P981652220" "Pathetic!  All of you!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3141650843" "This part of Port Recluse is...well there's stuff down there, but nothing worth putting this walkie talkie away for."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P572996736" "Yep.  I see them over there.  Not yet.  Not close enough yet."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2785847174" "I see something.  Over and out."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P959216735" "Going radio silent.  Some action just showed up.  Out."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3560873182" "Looks like the fun bus just arrived.  I'm gonna go punch a ticket."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P635952226" "Hey, could be worse.  We could be on the night patrol."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1256024505" "Stick together, guys.  No wandering."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P432536731" "You.  Watch yourself."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1540110770" "I got my eye on you."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3142856711" "Keeping this Port secure is an honor.  You could be doing garbage detail.  Think about it."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3888527327" "This day just got more interesting!"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4263408839" "The sun's shining and blood's about to spill.  Does it really get any better?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P108166363" "Hey, you look tired.  How about a dirt nap?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_DAYPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3986382438" "This patrol just got a lot more interesting!"

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4291911908" "No, we don't use flashlights on patrol at night.  We could.  Or...we could just wear neon targets.  How would that be?"
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4178949583" "Don't complain.  Night patrols are always more exciting than day patrols."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P970689591" "Keep up, men.  This isn't a stroll, you know."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2038804544" "Well of course I'd rather be patrolling with the women.  It's not going to happen.  Give it up."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1558963327" "Patrolling with the Widows and Fortunatas?  It's called a pipe dream.  Wake up."

// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2967623007" "It's a shame this fight will only last a few minutes.  I  think I'd enjoy beating you longer."
// SHARKHEAD_PRECLUSE_NIGHTPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P730498589" "I smell a toe tag coming on."

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2268399418" "Look alive, ladies."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P652656900" "Blood will spill this day, I am sure of it."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3551189088" "We will be underestimated, I can guarantee you of that.  A statement will need to be made."
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P198759084" "Step lively, ladies.  The patrol has just begun."

// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2776918531" "Remember!  Make a statement!"
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4215044389" "As I predicted!  Blood will spill!"
// SHARKHEAD_VILLA_FEMALEPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2469451591" "Your time here has ended."

// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3075553845" "Yeah, we have some presence in Babylon.  We're keeping the riff raff in check."
// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1757467195" "Hey, you up for some target practice with the Freakshow later?  They've kindly 'volunteered' to be targets."
// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2763059510" "Man, I hate working with the Fortunatas.  They never talk to me."
// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3843466311" "Hey, we can stand here and harass people as they get off the Ferry.  Wanna?"

// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER2_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3538953319" "Good stuff."
// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER2_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P686628798" "Works for me."
// STM_ENTRY_CHATTER2_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P549579537" "Hehe."

// STM_ENTRY_CLIPBOARD_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P435337547" "Hold it...was it 167 or 168?  I lost count..."
// STM_ENTRY_CLIPBOARD_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2196743234" "Hm..."
// STM_ENTRY_CLIPBOARD_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1021494791" "Well that doesn't look right..."
// STM_ENTRY_CLIPBOARD_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2320554945" "Shhhh, guys.  I'm trying to count here.  You're throwing me off."

// STM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1237150279" "All is clear here at present."
// STM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2747315617" "What else do you see, my dear?  Certainly I'll pass it along."
// STM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P39604636" "Look alive, sir. We must not be careless.  Weapon at the ready."

// STM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1090681996" "Ah, let the games begin."
// STM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3192689244" "Aha...and the fly lands in the web..."
// STM_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4196233409" "Team, I do believe we have a target."

// STM_ORDERS_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2593174671" "Okay, here's the detail.  We're going to check out the south quadrant then move up to the west."
// STM_ORDERS_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1862482457" "Hey...I have the clipboard.  Unless you're a mind-reader, shut it."
// STM_ORDERS_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1332893570" "Okay, teams of two.  Patrols to the north and east.  Any questions?"

// STM_ORDERS_COMMANDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P2204923108" "Hey!"
// STM_ORDERS_COMMANDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P952330753" "You there!"
// STM_ORDERS_COMMANDER_ATTACK_TEXT :
"P558206196" "Get 'em!"

// STM_PATROL_DD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1319277405" "We'll make one more pass and then head back to our start point."
// STM_PATROL_DD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2492746485" "Okay, anyone that gets in...I get first dibs."
// STM_PATROL_DD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2992027810" "Do we HAVE to fire a warning shot or can we just go straight to it?"

// STM_PATROL_DD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1634272493" "Double Down is our base.  Feel free to terrorize at will."
// STM_PATROL_DD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1466376974" "I don't see why we have to patrol.  Can't we just blast them to smithereens with the turrets?"
// STM_PATROL_DD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P267169476" "It's a small base, but it's our base.  Trespassers may be shot on sight."

// STM_PATROL_BM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P156643920" "I didn't sign up for Black Mariah.  I wanted the casino."
// STM_PATROL_BM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2919249136" "I wonder how hard it would be to get a transfer to the Jackpot patrol.  I bet that one is interesting."
// STM_PATROL_BM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1097898883" "Hold up, I think we have a straggler."

// STM_PATROL_BM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P67312250" "And now the patrol gets interesting."
// STM_PATROL_BM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4012134365" "LIFE is pain.  Embrace it!"
// STM_PATROL_BM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3731272259" "Come here so I can hit you."

// STM_PATROL_FL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1439233035" "I didn't sign up for The Flop.  I wanted Black Mariah.  That's where the Fortunatas are."
// STM_PATROL_FL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1009080318" "I say after this patrol we go shake down some casino patrons.  How'd that be?"
// STM_PATROL_FL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P240363237" "No, I don't see why we can't stray from the patrol for a few minutes to go check out Babylon."

// STM_PATROL_FL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1995021303" "And now the Flop patrol gets interesting."
// STM_PATROL_FL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1277972649" "LIFE is pain, meat.  Embrace it."
// STM_PATROL_FL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1790267859" "Come closer. Let me show you my claws."

// STM_PATROL_JP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3464979298" "Anything suspicious, I get to shoot first.  You shot first last time."
// STM_PATROL_JP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2366524229" "Back up.  Your claw keeps jabbing into my arm."
// STM_PATROL_JP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2060468108" "One sec.  I got hung up on something back there."

// STM_PATROL_JP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1032825788" "Let the games begin!"
// STM_PATROL_JP_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3573109987" "This wretched patrol just got more interesting!  About time!"

// STM_PATROL_HW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1979021314" "Now THIS patrol is more like it.  I bet we'll see some real action."
// STM_PATROL_HW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2555801397" "I love this patrol.  Hard Way is like a feast for the senses.  Always something going on."
// STM_PATROL_HW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P431904795" "Whoa.  Did you see that ghosty thing?  Can we shoot some later?"

// STM_PATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1606351679" "Yes!  Action!"
// STM_PATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2368653505" "Forget stun, people, let's go for maim or dental records only!"
// STM_PATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2526379669" "I see someone! Over there!"
// STM_PATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2299350255" "You!  Yes, you!  You're dead!"

// STM_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2186633919" "I don't know how many times I have to say this.  Precision is not a bad word.  It's a GOOD word."
// STM_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3179346632" "Play time is later.  Work time is now.  Let's do some."
// STM_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P945411835" "Is that the best you got?"

// STM_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1013248344" "Lesson later.  Pain and suffering now."
// STM_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1936665927" "You there!  You're dead!"
// STM_TRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4113698054" "Forget what I said!  Just start shooting!"

// STM_TRAINING_DRILL_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1011674359" "Faster!"
// STM_TRAINING_DRILL_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3121783326" "No!  My pet iguana has more coordination than you guys!  Again!"
// STM_TRAINING_DRILL_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1795397717" "Acceptable is no better than failure!  I want excellence!"
// STM_TRAINING_DRILL_YELL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3443933164" "You guys are killing me here.  Again!"

// STM_TRAINING_DRILL_YELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P212002548" "Drills later.  Time to put skills to use NOW."
// STM_TRAINING_DRILL_YELL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4123694273" "Fresh meat for the grinder!"

// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P268098278" "Treat that weapon as loaded, men.  I'd prefer you keep your toes.  It's not mandatory, but I'd prefer it."
// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3605223049" "I don't care if it's loaded or not.  If I see any of you waving your gun around again, I will squish you."
// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P322684227" "Safety, soldier!  Safety!  Safety!  Safety!  Use it!"
// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P720088817" "You're killin' me.  You're really killin' me here."

// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P760542641" "Safeties OFF!"
// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3257518111" "If it's not loaded, throw it!  I don't care!  Attack!"
// STM_WEAPONCHECK_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4176196506" "Lessons OVER!"


// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P279626249" "We have company.  Let's make sure they don't leave without a proper welcome."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1656975915" "Welcome to our base.  How may I make your day more miserable?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_EXAMINEBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2422332172" "Sure.  Come right on in.  Wanna see what I'm working on?  NOT."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P188282162" "I'm just saying Double Down isn't exactly the best place for a career jump.  Now if you get an assignment in The Hard Way...THEN you're going places."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P565335750" "Wanna head over to the casino later for some rest, relaxation, and civilian harassment?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CHATTER_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2787710006" "I'm not saying I didn't like the movie.  I'm saying it's two hours of my life I will never get back."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1319994345" "What we have here doesn't justify exertion on my part.  Yet."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3964708575" "Of course it's not clear.  But I see nothing worth raising my weapon for yet."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026586391" "Hey, send over some lunch.  We're starving over here."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2304649976" "Base.  Gotta go.  Got something worth shooting at."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3017652058" "About time! Let's make some noise!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_GUARD_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3115383595" "LIFE is pain!  Embrace it!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_FREAKTARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P758835594" "This is better than pinball!  See that perfect outline?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_FREAKTARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P990699707" "You REALLY subdued him, right?  I don't want him waking up anytime soon."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_FREAKTARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2043545405" "Ah!  Inches!  See how close that was?  I'm amazing!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_FREAKTARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1290461102" "Okay, this one's for reals!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_FREAKTARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P715317879" "Forget 'close' on this one!  I'm going for puncture!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_FREAKTARGETPRACTICE_SHOOTER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1501933185" "Forget the Freak.  Get the meat!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2437613322" "I'm just saying...making the moves on your superior's girlfriend is probably not the best way to get ahead within the Recluse organization."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P33255439" "Hey, wanna go 'apprehend' some stragglers under the Giza later?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P323452910" "Wanna head over to the Giza after work?"

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P723745794" "We'll talk about this later.  Let's do some damage!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOITER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2776430745" "Come!  Let's see which of us is better!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P366857106" "I see what I always see.  Lots of not much."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3409967880" "Shh.  I was in the middle of a transmission."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3005276520" "When are you sending over lunch?  We're getting tired and hungry here."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4239832924" "I'm going to have to get back to you.  I just spotted something."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3775199153" "Wait.  Gotta go.  I see something."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2624592154" "Sweet.  Get back to you later.  I just saw me a big fat bulls-eye."

// STM_BLACKMARIAH_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4023977538" "Sir, please perform your task without conversation.  I will let you know when to shoot."
// STM_BLACKMARIAH_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P9567467" "Things will grow very interesting quite quickly.  Vigilance, sir."
// STM_BLACKMARIAH_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2643570362" "Just a moment, base.  My colleague's attention has begun to wander."

// STM_BLACKMARIAH_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3588595813" "Ahh...little fly.  Come closer.  Welcome to my web."
// STM_BLACKMARIAH_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1343092376" "I think, gentlemen, we now have something of interest to do."
// STM_BLACKMARIAH_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1382236910" "And so it begins..."

// STM_JACKPOT_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3564767491" "I'm not seeing anything.  You guys?"
// STM_JACKPOT_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P988714959" "Sh.  I'm looking."
// STM_JACKPOT_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4102097135" "Quiet.  I'm doing my job.  Would it kill you to do yours?"

// STM_JACKPOT_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3930874230" "If I didn't want you to bleed, I wouldn't hit you, now would I?"
// STM_JACKPOT_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4180634837" "There!  Finally some action!"
// STM_JACKPOT_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3296378414" "FINALLY!  You!  You're dead!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P490746070" "Do I have to repeat myself?  I'm only going to say this once."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P879387394" "Listen up!  I'm only going to give these orders ONE TIME."
// STM_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1370693551" "Okay, this comes directly from headquarters.  Pay ATTENTION!"

// STM_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3926096289" "We'll discuss this later.  For now...commence grievous injury!"
// STM_ALLHOODS_ORDERS_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3150606449" "We're not alone.  Let's inflict some pain."



// STM_MU_AIR_PATROL_FL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4130776759" "Fly higher."
// STM_MU_AIR_PATROL_FL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2478247518" "Higher..."
// STM_MU_AIR_PATROL_FL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P804607112" "Right behind you..."

// STM_MU_AIR_PATROL_FL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1786535541" "Pain begins now."
// STM_MU_AIR_PATROL_FL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1897267546" "I will obliterate you."
// STM_MU_AIR_PATROL_FL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2722332215" "You will not recover."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2982943451" "I can do a lot with this Mech."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P398026931" "New test subject.  It's okay if this experiment 'fails.'"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3904187410" "Whoa!  Witnesses are not something we can afford here!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_RESEARCHCOUNCILBOT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2847201452" "New project!"

// STM_SPIDERPATROL_HW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P888181899" "So much prey..."
// STM_SPIDERPATROL_HW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3511720324" "Feast for the eyes.  Let's keep going.  For now."
// STM_SPIDERPATROL_HW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1728569699" "My eyes are feasting.  So much prey."

// STM_SPIDERPATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2677260970" "And now...the games begin."
// STM_SPIDERPATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1289876699" "Welcome to my web."
// STM_SPIDERPATROL_HW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2886473652" "Come closer, fly.  Let's embrace, you and I."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEFREAK_FREEDFREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3638291563" "Not enough juice to keep me down for long!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEFREAK_FREEDFREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1241321685" "Pssst!  Guess who's awake!?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEFREAK_FREEDFREAK_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3403072598" "Let the chaos begin!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEDFREAK_SHOTGUNALERT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P749694744" "I'm mostly sure we got him fully subdued.  You can never tell with Freakshow."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEDFREAK_SHOTGUNALERT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1185205210" "Look, if he moves, I'll shoot him.  Okay?  What more do you want?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEDFREAK_SHOTGUNALERT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1383876448" "I THINK he's out."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEDFREAK_SHOTGUNALERT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1292534471" "Whoa!  Company arrived!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEDFREAK_SHOTGUNALERT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2109582664" "Uh...I think we got more problems than one not-so-subdued Freakshow."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_SUBDUEDFREAK_SHOTGUNALERT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1738376124" "Ut oh..."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_TSOO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4173107737" "The Tsoo will remember this day."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_TSOO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1093847445" "You will be remembered by the Tsoo.  I will guarantee it."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_TSOO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2955807301" "You've made a large error in judgment."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_TSOO_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1917126939" "Your error in judgment will be your doom!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_TSOO_ALERT_TEXT :
"P613807264" "Now life is interesting!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_TSOO_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3987698965" "Aha!  Interesting!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3108400174" "I think we should just wax 'em and be done with it."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P994216390" "Apprehend?  I may have heard 'apprehend.'  But maybe I heard 'annihilate', too."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3876606165" "I'm just saying...Double Down wouldn't exactly miss a few of these guys."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1509548106" "Go ahead and move.  It'll be your last."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3070864165" "I think it would be wise to just keep your hands against the wall."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2355240814" "Do not MOVE!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3924007893" "Whatcha doing here, hm?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2231888967" "I guess you weren't expecting us, were you?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2306078340" "Lookie what I caught in my web..."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2182128732" "That's it!  Lead magnets!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2831590576" "Targets are all OVER the Double Down today!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4212460031" "Forget containment!  Let's go for mayhem!"



// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P758407457" "I'm just saying...Giza wouldn't exactly miss a few of these guys."
// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2624220598" "Whatcha doing down here under the Giza, hm?"

// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P942201689" "Not alone!  Take care of it!"
// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1191564304" "More to the party is fine by me!"
// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3092281226" "Let's make some statements!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3759122450" "Hey, I was just spreading good cheer around Double Down.  You know me."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2396502027" "Chaos and mayhem.  Chaos and mayhem."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3048119499" "Eat lead."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3949915188" "Will you never learn?  Shoot first, ask questions later!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4185378648" "Sucker!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2292926242" "Bahahahaha!  Shoulda shot me!"

// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3388892235" "Hey, I was just spreading good cheer around Babylon.  You know me."
// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3757474054" "Hey, they wouldn't let me inside Giza through the front doors."


// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1540509785" "Oh man, you're makin' a mistake.  Family don't take too kindly to this kinda stuff."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3450664669" "You're makin' a huge mistake, pal.  All I'm sayin'."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2065976065" "You got no business with me, pal.  All I'm sayin'."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1951315112" "Eat lead, all of you!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P998570488" "If I'm goin' down, I'm takin' you with me!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3860052742" "The Family has a LONG memory!"

// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P669788950" "Not doin' nothin', man.  And even if I did, Family ain't gotta explain nothin' to nobody."
// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3131622618" "Yeah, you're makin' a big mistake.  Family's ties go deep."

// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3062454962" "Ha!  Oh this is too rich!"
// STM_GIZA_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4268769735" "Your luck just ran out, pal!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_CARNIVAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2064948071" "Sigh.  Such a mistake."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_CARNIVAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P778633629" "Such a painful mistake."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_CARNIVAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3991978162" "You shouldn't keep me here, dear."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_CARNIVAL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2996463879" "Ah, this will only end badly, my dear."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_CARNIVAL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3195249909" "As I predicted.  This will end badly.  For you!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P539483714" "Oh my dear, I think you underestimate me."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2437022350" "Shhh, my dear.  A gun is trained at the back of that pretty little head of yours."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P174584902" "Unless you'd like me to refresh your lipstick with a new shade of red, I suggest you close your mouth dear."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1238877545" "A little far from the circus tent, aren't you, dear?"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P759576025" "Let the claws come out, darling!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4123885436" "We shall do this painfully, you and I!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_APPREHEND_FEMALE_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3897180462" "Let's end the anticipation and go straight to blood-letting, shall we?"





// CAP_PTS_GUARD_ENTRANCE_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3172324899" "Move along, bud. This area is restricted to Arachnos and PTS personnel."
// CAP_PTS_GUARD_ENTRANCE_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1926898237" "I don't care if Doc Aeon himself sent you here, NO ENTRY!"
// CAP_PTS_GUARD_ENTRANCE_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2890895902" "You 'Destined' twerps are not welcome here."
// CAP_PTS_GUARD_ENTRANCE_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2522274893" "Buzz off or I'll set this big bot fella upon you."
// CAP_PTS_GUARD_ENTRANCE_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P459652092" "Restricted area. Move along."

// CAP_PTS_BOT_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3798860885" "Humanoid must not escape!"
// CAP_PTS_BOT_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3410108277" "Humanoid Anomaly Detected."
// CAP_PTS_BOT_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P812039398" "Search and Destroy Algorithm Engaged."

// CAP_PTS_BOTGUARD_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2133486981" "Sic the 'Bot on them!"

// CAP_HAVEN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1511797083" "If you get captured, you don't say a word!"
// CAP_HAVEN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P857786657" "Gold Brickers, Luddites, these rampaging 'Destined Ones'....  So many possible threats."
// CAP_HAVEN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2638163082" "Watch for fools hopping the fence.  This airstrip is under Lord Recluse's protection."
// CAP_HAVEN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P536030344" "I'm saving my wages to get a place up in New Haven.  That place is so much nicer than this hole."
// CAP_HAVEN_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3109349692" "Stay in formation. Dang it! <em t=4> I SAID, 'Stay in formation!'"

// CAP_HAVEN_PATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P435876457" "Under fire over here, sir!"



// STM_BLACKMARIAH_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P814316655" "I'm just saying...Black Mariah wouldn't exactly miss a few of these guys."
// STM_BLACKMARIAH_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3987994887" "Whatcha doing down here in Black Mariah, hm?"

// STM_BLACKMARIAH_APPREHEND_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1283338687" "We're not alone!  Take care of it!"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1066577911" "You don't have to talk.  Just like I don't have to miss when I shoot you."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4132830986" "Talk.  Don't talk.  It all ends the same once the blood starts flowing."
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1821190771" "I can make you regret getting up this morning."

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3134443970" "Interrogate later.   Shoot now!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3907448054" "Why must I always be disturbed when I'm in the middle of an interrogation?"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2611591718" "You're kidding me, right?"

// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1530021702" "I took a wrong, turn.  I swear!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3851760072" "I-I don't know what you want from me!  I didn't do anything!"
// STM_DOUBLEDOWN_CAUGHT_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3339222533" "What?  What did I do?"









// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1028522908" "I'm just saying...Jackpot wouldn't exactly miss a few of these guys."


// STM_ALLHOODS_GUARD_PEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2962006500" "I can't see much."
// STM_ALLHOODS_GUARD_PEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P870215868" "See anything?"
// STM_ALLHOODS_GUARD_PEER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2553094795" "This would be easier with modified binoculars."

// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1775829825" "Not there.  Over there."
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1817239666" "No, I didn't say there.  I said THERE."
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2892706721" "Did you not see me point?  I specifically said over there."
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3167820813" "Look, pal, I know you're new and all, but this isn't rocket science.  Just pick up, move, and put down."

// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3762335369" "Forget the crate.  We got bigger fish to fry."
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3623110109" "Plans just changed.  Put down the box."
// STM_ALLHOODS_SHIPMENT_CRATEMOVE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P941272183" "New orders, Wolf Spider.  We got company."



// STM_THEFLOP_SHIPMENT_MOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P787780932" "This clipboard says you are putting it in the wrong place.  All I'm sayin'."


// STM_GIZA_ROUSEBUM_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3141601662" "Get up, ya bum.  Go home."
// STM_GIZA_ROUSEBUM_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1078471230" "Kidding me, right?  Get him up and send him home."
// STM_GIZA_ROUSEBUM_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1457552771" "You!  Up!  Now!  Go home!"

// STM_THEFLOP_SPIDERLING_SWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2306094043" "Clickety.  Click.  Click."


// STM_THEFLOP_SPIDERLING_SWARM_GO_ORDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3377339313" "Clickety.  Click.  Click.  Target."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3346385751" "Look alive, ladies.  We will be underestimated.  Again."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1795349623" "I'll be sure to let you know if anything worthy comes up, dears."
// STM_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4056039935" "Hmm...  Not long now, ladies."

// STM_THEFLOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2185812475" "Ah!  As I predicted."
// STM_THEFLOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1902528096" "The Flop will remember that we were here."
// STM_THEFLOP_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P742619509" "Let the games begin, ladies."

// STM_ALLHOODS_LOOKOUT_WALKIETALKIEFEMALE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1796310443" "St. Martial will remember that we were here."

// STM_ALLHOODS_GUARD_PEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P417068914" "Hold up!  I see some fun coming this way."
// STM_ALLHOODS_GUARD_PEER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2252050385" "Oh...the fun is about to start NOW."

// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1789643684" "Welcome to hell."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1486743669" "I can stand here all day, pal.  Sooner or later you're gonna get tired.  And then you'll make a mistake."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2580018807" "Nice suit.  Hope it deflects massive weapon fire."

// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P758191901" "You lookin' for trouble?"
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P237774432" "I didn't see an invitation in your hand."
// STM_FLOP_FACEOFF_TAUNT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1085839730" "Minding your own business is clearly NOT in your vocabulary."

// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4211839835" "You got nothin' on us!"
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1592917683" "Aww... We was just mindin' our own business."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1196299309" "You guys are the real criminals here. This here is a classic shakedown."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1558744951" "Dang."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4043288430" "This the end, Frankie?"

// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3991784581" "Now's our chance. Take this fool out, then we take down these other guys."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P448742358" "Three-way standoff.  Nice."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3111946228" "I got that one."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FAMILY_ALERT_TEXT :
"P212997537" "Focus on the new guy, first."

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1465879439" "This won't do at all.  You are behaving in a prohibited manner!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4126163967" "Commission of a crime within 500 yards of a Casino or gaming establishment.  That's going to be a big, big fine."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2912433243" "The penalty for your criminal activity is going to be really painful. I promise."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3797947616" "Hmmmm... looks like we caught some more small fry. Not going to toss you back in, though."
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1714761939" "Petty thugs, the lot of you."

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P356139075" "Do not interfere with my duties!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3248816445" "Beat it, thug!"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFAMILY_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P574588375" "Lookin' for trouble?  You got it!"

// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2689958177" "You think it's easy to 'assume the position' with my arms like this?"

// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2207387678" "Now's our chance!"
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_AGAINSTWALL_FREAKSHOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P751308795" "Take this jerk out, then gank the other guys when they're not looking."

// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_FREAK_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3050972884" "I'm just saying... The Jackpot wouldn't exactly miss a few of these guys."
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_FREAK_THREATEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1009019739" "Whatcha doing over here in the Jackpot, hm?"

// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_FREAK_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P317313429" "Why must I always be disturbed when I'm in the middle of an interrogation!"
// STM_JACKPOT_APPREHEND_FREAK_THREATEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2391982412" "Go back to the casinos, tourist."

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFREAK_INTERROGATOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2616480348" "Stick to playing the slots, punk. Oh! One-armed bandit! I just got why you call the Freakshow that!"

// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFREAK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P316853407" "Hey, what's this?"
// STM_JACKPOT_CAUGHTFREAK_INTERROGATOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3941949014" "Hey!  Stand 200 feet back... Citizen."

// SIRENSCALL_DRONE_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P390332669" "Hm...looking better.  A few more tweaks, I think."
// SIRENSCALL_DRONE_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3642354702" "We need to get these drones working for the next ship."
// SIRENSCALL_DRONE_FIX_OBSERVER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3133469707" "Lovely job, dear.  Very nice."

// SIRENSCALL_DRONE_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1933803763" "I see something!"
// SIRENSCALL_DRONE_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4168622507" "Oh, my dear, you are really quite doomed."
// SIRENSCALL_DRONE_FIX_OBSERVER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P556059196" "Our plans have changed!"

// PORTALCORP_ATTACK_ARACHNOS_LEADER_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3967164297" "<em point f=21>Alpha Team, take the left. <em point f=22>Bravo team, take the center. <em attack>Show no mercy!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3679266364" "This has GOT to be illegal."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4287033317" "Since when do I need to present an ID card just to get through?  This is ridiculous."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3037141543" "You can't do this.  You simply cannot do this."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1143944019" "I'm appalled at this treatment.  APPALLED."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P491478140" "I'm not showing you my ID.  I don't trust you."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2894439229" "This is a human rights violation.  My lawyer will not think too kindly of this."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P473327549" "We've been here too long.  My coffee's getting cold."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1895453442" "If I'd known the wait would be so long I would have asked for a thermos."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3051232439" "This is simply ridiculous."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4267041506" "I have never been treated so unfairly in all my life."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3939068160" "You are not going to get away with this!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3980503710" "You are a very bad person!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1252632467" "This is absolutely ridiculous!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P147389716" "Not on the list."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4285219136" "You're not on the list."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2375418384" "This is not an acceptable form of photo identification."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P223892789" "I won't let you through until you provide an acceptable form of identification."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P542255599" "We got another one that's not on the list."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1009364556" "Last four digits are 9-3-2.  No?  Okay.  Thanks."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P493423472" "Repeat?  Over."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1214682249" "No, sir.  Last name is Smythe, not Smith.  With an 'e' on the end."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P938675514" "Relocate to the same quadrant?  It's full?  Okay.  Sector G then."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3460570985" "Oh I know YOU'RE not on the list!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P424995296" "Unauthorized access!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3732972378" "Without proper identification, you cannot pass!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2098303096" "Stop!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2901585601" "Freeze!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P891661884" "Fire!  Then ask questions!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3183953614" "Quiet.  I'm on a break."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P141753764" "See this?  Coffee.  When it's gone, we can talk."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1004795110" "Can't talk on break."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P358158829" "Sorry.  On break."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P391728310" "I don't hear you while I'm on break."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P756099388" "See this?  This is me throwing down my coffee so I can attack you!  WASTE!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1356506433" "You're making me leave my break early!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_IDCHECK_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4029357714" "That was french roast!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1337769255" "No one told me when I came here I'd have to go through these kinds of hoops.  What are they checking for, anyway?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4052930535" "This seems sort of excessive."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2979271717" "Why do I need all this identification?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3090177090" "We've been here too long."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3931489502" "We've been here for over four hours.  This is ridiculous."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3428075981" "Who is in charge of this atrocity?  I know my rights.  They can't keep up waiting here like this."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4211879794" "Where are they taking everyone?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P528076733" "You guys are crazy and really mean!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2323194646" "I know my rights!  You can't do this!  I'm calling my lawyer!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2305887403" "This is totally unfair!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_NPCCITIZEN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1380926914" "Just who do you people think you are???"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3144351413" "You've been flagged.  Don't move."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P477585213" "You're not in the database.  Wait a moment."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2436730633" "Hm...well that's not good."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1644899803" "Another form of identification, please."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_LAPTOP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1417514975" "Insufficient.  Another form of indentification, please."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2762822925" "Control?  We got another one that's not on the list."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2138655106" "Sawyer.  That's what he says.  No, the name is flagged.  Right.  I'll send him over."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1124623435" "They're starting to pile up over here.  Can we send some over to your section for holding?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2343652281" "Yes, sir.  Right away.  Over.  We're sending the next lot to Sector D."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3779742295" "You're not allowed to be here!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1000135790" "Control, send over some reinforcements!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2682757842" "No unauthorized access!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3039772906" "Set an example!  Leave no trace!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2837225168" "See this?  Coffee.  Don't bug me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2346715916" "See this?  Coffee.  Don't talk to me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3194940739" "See this?  It says I'm on break."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1333639204" "Don't bother me, I'm on a break."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1850458858" "I'm going to hurt you purely on principle.  That coffee wasn't free."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P845123022" "You made me spill!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_IDCHECK_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P372404184" "You're not supposed to be here!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981139159" "It's under control.  Last time was a fluke."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2824730141" "Let's take care of some business!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2785245289" "You don't want to go up against Arachnos.  You will LOSE."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1926729888" "You're nothing to us.  But I'm happy to waste some fire power on you."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2815137114" "Aggression target acquired!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3511443255" "Control, we got some unauthorized access.  Out."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P637222625" "Yeah, we're good here.  A few minor skirmishes with illegals."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P929965033" "They're getting pretty tense over here.  Can I send a few over to you guys?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P676982861" "I'll take care of it.  Out."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P275483541" "Shoot first!  Ask questions later!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P466667443" "Unauthorized personnel will be shot!  Survivors, go ahead and shoot them again!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CHECKPOINT_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2507697320" "You're in the WRONG place at the wrong time, pal."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3153462143" "No."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P116667105" "Not in this life, pal."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3468314514" "You may NOT enter."


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D5_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2503188577" "Fire in the hole!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D5_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3015670759" "This...is so cool.  Ready?  Fire in the hole!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D5_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2785157393" "Stand back or prepare to lose some eyebrows!  Fire in the hole!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D5_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P34745444" "Hello!  Grenade!  Interruption?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D6_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1109732234" "Now remember!  When the pin is pulled, Mr. Grenade is not our friend."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D6_GRENADETOSSER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P107655864" "This will flush them out for sure!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D6_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P460664089" "You picked a BAD time to stumble in here unannounced and unauthorized!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FIREINTHEHOLE_D6_GRENADETOSSER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3069374199" "You're kidding me, right??"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3843118174" "YOU the monsters!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1433298953" "You evil!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1712171379" "Me do nothing wrong!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P575672030" "You make me and you try to break me!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P65991662" "You very bad!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1623394018" "Me hands up!  Don't shoot!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1465483002" "You monster, too!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P696222481" "You bad!  Very bad!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P407674654" "You with them!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1980400107" "You bad bad, too!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3707896975" "Well hello there.  You're not going anywhere anytime soon."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1232890781" "Your day will get a whole lot worse if you move."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3492648802" "Now I've got you.  Best that you stay right there."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2130887054" "Looks like we got a live one this time."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2687790058" "I'm ready for a little chop chop chop!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1417661167" "It's sharp and it shoots.  Let me give you a demonstration!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2379823743" "Me do nothing!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P902840880" "Me do nothing wrong!  Let me go!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_ARACHNOIDVICTIM_ALERT_TEXT :
"P920827298" "You pay, too!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2406799185" "Well, hello there.  You're not going anywhere anytime soon."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4076207373" "Don't...move."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3990593123" "I'm quite prepared to blow you wide open."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1379145437" "Hm...looks like we got another one here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3539571354" "I'm only saying this one time.  Don't move."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_FLUSHEMOUT_D6_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2098106843" "Keep your hands up.  I'm only going to tell you once."


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2396200818" "Shhh...stay back.  Quiet.  Control?  Yeah, I think we're coming upon something big here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1719358793" "Shhh...stay back."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3633648945" "Quiet."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2438428731" "I heard something."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2285149341" "Stay down.  I think I heard something."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2486504102" "Was I right or was I right!?  Attack!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P323295583" "I knew it!  Fire!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2523928042" "Now!  Go go go!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3630366241" "Shhh!  Down!  Get down!  Stay there."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3923322054" "Quiet!  Get down."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1756862396" "Hold it.  I heard something.  Get down."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3858017860" "Down.  I heard something."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1683791354" "Let's go, let's go!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1642318965" "Now!  Move!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2812878747" "Go!  Go go go!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D5_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3043893394" "Shoot!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1800498504" "Quiet.  Control?  I think we got something."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2660786040" "Silence.  Control?  I think we have something here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1636767027" "Shhh...stay behind me.  I may need assistance.  Out."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3676462657" "I knew it!  Attack!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2215011053" "There!  Get them!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1114086352" "Over there!  Strike!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P269359060" "Shhh...get down.  I heard something."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3492905571" "You hear that? Get down."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3779059731" "Quiet.  Get down.  I heard something."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1140087985" "Gotta go!  Bad guys!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P740686053" "Move it!  Move it!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_HALTEDPATROL_D6_WALKIETALKIE_GETDOWN_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3654174130" "Attack!  Let's go!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3467265430" "Ha! I see myself!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1604687353" "Wow, his influence really does reach far and wide."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3681479425" "Hm.  Didn't know he was still alive."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046391802" "Interesting."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4239275319" "Get your own newspaper!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P361861717" "You are BAD NEWS."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1778660395" "I'm gonna be your bad news for the days."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2986613514" "A paper cut is going to be the least of your worries."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2945229634" "Are you on extermination patrol this week?  The Gutter's getting pretty full again."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2726432318" "I'm thinking of seeking a promotion over in Spider City.  I think I've earned it."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1026853358" "I was scanning buildings last week.  There are a lot more of those things than we thought."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P602715894" "You're kidding me.  She said that?  What else did she say?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3145581523" "All I am saying is, don't bother.  Those Fortunatas are off limits."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2493553564" "The time is right for fighting!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P774035757" "Looks like the Gutter needs some more cleaning."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P697745976" "I don't like you.  That's enough reason."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1157545982" "You're in for a lot of pain."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2448778714" "Come right on in to my conversation.  Of course you're welcome!  Dork!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P587882363" "Great.  My coffee's cold."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3398344215" "Hey, this isn't French Roast."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1285518021" "Dangit.  I specifically asked for Robust Blend."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1533261266" "Who took my Half-Caf Vanilla Soy Caramel Double Froth-Whip."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3693203068" "Yeah... I'm just not strong enough to try the Recluse' Mystery blend."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3738893801" "Hmmm.... Do I taste a hint of chicory in this?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1989964690" "Oh GREAT.  I spilled.  You are going to pay for that!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3370097223" "More trash to clean up here in the Gutter!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2365840127" "They're going to have to scrape you up with toothpicks!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P796955043" "Break time is over!  Commence bloody beating!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1953379310" "You're kidding me, right?  RIGHT?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1678763105" "Uh...yeah, we're just on our way back, control.  Just finishing up some business here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1712222963" "We're on it.  Just finishing up here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4235617315" "Sure thing, Control.  We're almost done here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2177733915" "Yep.  Break's almost over.  We'll head up now."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P464013581" "Finish your coffee and let's go!  We got work to do!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4251016030" "Break time's over!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4027573864" "We got hostiles!  Out!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3435676779" "Work just came to us!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2890487791" "Hm.  They spelled our name wrong."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1038419869" "Crey's in the news again."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P547834337" "Pocket what?  I'll have to check that out."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3210779192" "I can't believe you just interrupted me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P610074148" "You're going to wish very dearly that you had no interrupted me."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2682485775" "I'm going to put you in the news.  How about the Obits section?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026472300" "The Gutter has become more infested.  We're going to need to do another round of cleaning soon."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P82944712" "We flush them out.  What happens after that...not my problem."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3903304933" "They're all over the place.  I thought we were gaining control of the situation, but they just keep appearing."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3457677805" "I'm on Web patrol later.  Should be interesting."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P555291696" "Take 'em out.  NOW."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2121018116" "Fire at will!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2570224435" "Take them down!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1082620275" "Forget precision.  Just start shooting!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4225326620" "We'll be right up.  Finishing up breaks here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2974566905" "Sure, we'll see you in ten."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3943943146" "On my way.  Out."


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P835949856" "Who took my Half-Caf Vanilla Soy Caramel Double Froth-Whip?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3140181109" "You're dead!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2654906915" "I'm going to rip you in two!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_LOITER_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P930143514" "I don't care who you think you are, you'll bleed just like all the rest!"

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1039911725" "Tangle's clear for the moment."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P455250993" "We're good here."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4004419235" "Yes, sir.  Keep your eyes peele, squad.  Some real undesirables lurking about lately."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P988645355" "Sure.  We got it covered.  Out."

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3911122759" "I take that back.  We got some issues here."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1316027939" "Retract.  We got issues.  Talk to you later."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P594420062" "Scratch that, sir.  We got some activity here.  Out!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_LOOKOUT_D7_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P61569660" "Over and out!  Guys!  No prisoners!"









// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_TECH_CHECKIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2761212671" "Yep.  He's just finishing up with the wires now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_TECH_CHECKIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3909436920" "We're good here.  He's just finishing up."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_TECH_CHECKIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1840797542" "Give us about two more minutes."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_TECH_CHECKIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2335549727" "A few more minutes and we're good to go."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_TECH_CHECKIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3026361786" "He's making a few adjustments and then we're good for detonation."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_TECH_CHECKIN_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P695900177" "Almost clear to go, sir."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1826482171" "How are we doing, guys?  Those explosives ready to go yet?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P192852737" "Status report.  Over."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2217445078" "Check in.  Over."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2428450524" "Team two, check in."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1620079886" "Team one, check in."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3656541032" "Hostiles spotted!  Watch your back!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3813763437" "We're not clear here!  Watch out, they could be heading your way!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2252411926" "Forget the wires!  We got action here!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_WALKIETALKIE_COMMANDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P135532684" "Forget the detonation!  We got action over here!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_SHOOER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3400802438" "Move along."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_SHOOER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1598254771" "Nothing to see here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_SHOOER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P56340382" "What?  You've never seen explosives before?  This the Rogue Isles.  Move on."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_SHOOER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4168990225" "You never saw a thing."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2880397245" "Mm...good stuff.  Oh.  Yeah, the wires look good, too."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1543794947" "Mph.  Yeah, looks good."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2020596223" "Good job.  I'm watching.  Very carefully.  This is good stuff."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3942687066" "Good job.  Precise.  Good blend."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2506976501" "You again!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2087530069" "Coming back for more punishment?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D5_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3949289439" "I see you've set aside this time to be humiliated by Arachnos."




// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D6_SHOOER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P941011461" "Move along.  Nothing to see here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D6_SHOOER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P430800376" "What?  You've never seen explosives before?  This the Rogue Isles.  Shut your gaping yap and move on."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D6_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3626901323" "There are few problems that can't be solved with high explosives."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PLANTEXPLOSIVES_D6_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P874799332" "Why must you come back for more punishment?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3747208097" "You're a mistake!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P906028842" "One way or another, we're taking you down!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2511843079" "You are a mistake!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P208623323" "You are a botched experiment!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P240841512" "You are a mistake I'm quite willing to correct!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1906841367" "I'm going to erase you from the equation, Arachnoid!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1746310325" "They're going to have to clean you up with toothpicks, Arachnoid!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3941286933" "You want some, too?  Happy to oblige!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1902787231" "You, too?  Taking all comers!  Let's go!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2752449712" "Oh, you think so?  Come on, meat!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P244737053" "You so evil!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P858860436" "Me no mistake!  You bad bad people!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3660315718" "Me get you!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3106654170" "Me get you back!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1913362323" "Cruel!  You cruel!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3830765257" "You evil, too!  You with them!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P968980921" "You very bad, too!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P354279441" "I hurt you, too!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSARACHNOIDS_D5_ARACHNOIDS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3518311769" "I no like you, either!"





// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3136718958" "Don't move.  Unless you want to become an arachnoid-kebab."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P354374199" "I can make this painful or I can make this excruciating.  Your choice."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3205863263" "If you move a muscle, I'll blow it off."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2073036324" "Whatever twitches becomes my new target."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1680011327" "This is none of your business!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3785371635" "You should have kept going!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3537881784" "Sanctioned interrogation and you are INTERRUPTING!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P438673119" "No witnesses!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUNDUP_D5_MACECHAT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2011186743" "No survivors!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3480819206" "We got some in here.  Hey, add this building to the list."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P620106722" "I'm not getting a reading here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2931485424" "Hard to tell on this one.  I'm getting a lot of interference."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P322153268" "We have Arachnoid activity in here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P619249930" "Affirmative for Arachnoids.  Put this building on the list."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3693862496" "Little help here?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P604957920" "Hostiles!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1656917209" "Intruders!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1583233912" "Unauthorized personnel!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3671600975" "Well?  How we doing guys?  Do we have Arachnoids inside or not?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1409353325" "Status report."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4286555921" "Give me an update."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P858760047" "How are we doing?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2776287518" "What's the status?"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2044096126" "Get up here!  NOW!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3858161527" "Abort!  We got a problem over here!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1774844395" "Forget the scan!  We got bigger problems!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANBUILDING_D5_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2125537805" "Get over here!  Abort!"





// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P453018410" "Don't move.  I'm scanning."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P236707866" "If you move I have to re-scan you.  If I have to re-scan you I will make you bleed."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1287221774" "It may be that your sole purpose in life is simply to serve as a warning to others."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P88226375" "All things being equal, you lose."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2830028410" "You're next!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1397177853" "If I could I'd set this scanner to 'liquidate'!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P654657995" "If I could, I'd set this scanner to 'incinerate'!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_SCANNER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1092600211" "Scan interrupted!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1890263268" "You can't do this!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P994103120" "I'm going to sue you."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2667827210" "What on earth are you scanning us for?"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2497269923" "What are you looking for?  This is insane!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2402484536" "Speed dialing my lawyer!  Right now!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3264195531" "You think you can treat us like this?  You thought wrong!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P2894327484" "I'm documenting ALL of this!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SCANVAGRANTS_D5_NPCVICTIM_FLEE_TEXT :
"P3633941327" "The proper authorities are going to hear about this!"





// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_STAIRGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1112075949" "See these stairs?  You can't go up them."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_STAIRGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P36732187" "Unauthorized access to the stairs is forbidden."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_STAIRGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1585330581" "You are not allowed to enter."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_STAIRGUARD_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4218681226" "Halt."


// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3463247583" "This section of Spider City is manageable.  Out."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P671683730" "Guard duty is just part of the job.  Don't let the boredom show, though."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3002726238" "Stay alert. You'd be surprised what waltzes through Spider City."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1965355654" "Most fortified city in the world. Seems like everyone wants in here."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2224598162" "Guard duty may stink, but you could be working the immigration line down at the docks."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P319828180" "I'll get back to you.  Got some business to take care of."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3480403849" "Going to need some reinforcements here."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2393817750" "Jeez, only 5 minutes until the end of my shift, too."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2849433216" "Form up and attack, ladies."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARD_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3925862258" "Stray intruder!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1040053148" "Up and over this way."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1779907988" "Bank left up ahead."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2559279465" "Bank right up ahead."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3400769395" "Slow.  Keep an eye out."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3835562006" "I sensed this!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1410800942" "Target spotted."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_MUAIRPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3966504655" "Follow me!  I just spotted something."







// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P87429317" "This way."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3490521158" "Stay close together."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P851048661" "Up ahead, make a left."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3920067492" "Up ahead, make a right."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P836941599" "Stay tight."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P145055611" "Keep Spider City secure."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P767372140" "Let's do what we're paid for!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3299344575" "Target spotted!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3280997135" "Not today!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_PATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P521782913" "Got one!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2694456952" "Keep The Gutter secure."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2125161822" "Stick together.  Make no mistake.  I will leave you behind."


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_PATROL_D6_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3624480077" "Stick close together.  Make no mistake.  I will leave you behind."


// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_PATROL_D7_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P729305254" "Keep The Tangle secure."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_PATROL_D7_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2268144361" "Stick close together. Make no mistake.  I will leave you behind."




// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1785818090" "We're a smaller patrol.  Keep together."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2302803345" "If you stray, you could get picked off."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2442489388" "No stragglers.  This is a small patrol.  We stick together."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3836472491" "Over this way."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2929141425" "Follow me."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3387614062" "Move!  Let's go!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1412026879" "Fire!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P931736551" "Let's clean up Spider City!"




// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_SMALLPATROL_D9_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2075964639" "Let's clean up The Tangle!"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3295753110" "I hate the Circle!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1429405410" "You shall not get far into Spider City!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4067734996" "We're going to wipe you out of Spider City, Thorns!"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4255376421" "You want some?"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2669770412" "We'll take you on, too.  It's no problem!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1682313242" "Fine!  Jump on in!  We'll wipe the floor with you, too!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2810369253" "You are DONE, Circle!"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1333669324" "I hate Arachnos!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3315581551" "We got this far through your defenses!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P747645045" "You are bags of brainless meat!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P321912215" "Your words mean nothing to Circle of Thorns!"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2102721263" "You will perish as well!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3551536393" "Choose sides, brother!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1908889037" "You are nothing!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSCOT_D1_COT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3134070003" "The Circle of Thorns is not scared of the likes of you!"





// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4107446980" "You're grossly outnumbered here, Longbow!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1173659479" "You got no chance, Longbow!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2344442245" "All things being equal, Longbow, you lose."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1058337294" "You may pretend you don't like me, but deep down, I know you hate me."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3242956422" "We're gonna wipe the floor with you, Longbow!"

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1533297533" "You want some, too?"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1516979250" "You have some nerve stepping in on something that isn't any of your business!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1752055354" "We'll take you on, too."
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1610081552" "Taking all comers!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3841503069" "Oh, you think so?  I think no."

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3231488931" "Quit talking and prepare for some pain!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3731442775" "We're not afraid of you, Arachnos!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P684956235" "We'll bring the pain as long as there's fight left in us!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P267824391" "Your tyranny won't last forever!"

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3108885173" "You made some big bad choices!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P44029311" "You sure picked the wrong fight to join AND you picked the wrong side!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2166166223" "Wrong move, pal!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3237009747" "You picked the wrong fight!"





// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1810063480" "Stay in formation..."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P750382672" "Everyone fears us, even our Bane Spider siblings."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1125958118" "We are the most feared of Arachnos.  As it should be."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2066826127" "Follow along."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2576735913" "Cast fear in the hearts of any who travel through Spider City."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3556240289" "Destroy them!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2618146865" "Strike them down."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_SPIDERPATROL_D1_ALERT_TEXT :
"P609269233" "For Lord Recluse!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SPIDERPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2319688508" "Cast fear in the hearts of any who travel through The Gutter."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SPIDERPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3018389377" "Use your poison!"


// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_SPIDERPATROL_D6_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3769166364" "Our primary objective is to clean up The Gutter.  Starting now!"

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_SPIDERPATROL_D7_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1536197398" "Cast fear in the hearts of any who travel up here in The Tangle."

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_SPIDERPATROL_D7_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3778891817" "Our primary objective is to clean up The Tangle.  Starting now!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_SPIDERPATROL_D7_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2500020104" "Drop them from the rooftops if you must!  Just destroy them!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1231626769" "You there.  Up.  Now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3049182940" "Get up.  Now."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1684165157" "Great another one.  Get up.  NOW."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4256096846" "This is not a hotel.  Get up!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P821823453" "Come on, come on.  Get up."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4239144593" "What!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2489321778" "WHAT?!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3515220991" "Mind your own business!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_ROUSEBUM_D5_FLASHLIGHT_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3288670829" "You want some trouble?  I'll give you some trouble!"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_CRAB_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3597882565" "You're not getting in here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_CRAB_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1169020970" "Don't even think about it."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_CRAB_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2152787492" "No while I'm standing here."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_CRAB_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P130210054" "Not while there's breath in my lungs."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_CRAB_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1019578147" "Not going to happen."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_CRAB_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1921045558" "Not in this life."

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_FORUNATA_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4200637623" "You may not enter."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_FORUNATA_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1036672571" "You are not permitted to pass."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_FORUNATA_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P659285347" "I'm afraid you cannot pass."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_FORUNATA_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1169472362" "I will not allow you to pass."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_DOORGUARD_FORUNATA_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2414026136" "I do not give you permission to pass."



// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P380091339" "I think I saw something."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1488770805" "The Radio has been chattering about nearby hostiles.  Pay attention."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3819015890" "I think we have something here."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2296101942" "Lookouts report a hostile nearby!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3163173129" "Target of opportunity...  Bonus to the fisrt one to land a hit!"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDFORTUNATA_D1_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1615998602" "My sisters around the city are sensing unusual creatures about."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDFORTUNATA_D1_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P634495788" "I sense them... THERE!"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P979779882" "Nothing on the horizon... so far."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P105596516" "Watch the horizon."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3474044933" "It's a looong way down, so be careful."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P798966626" "Last week I was on catwalk patrol and a Tarantula totally fell off into the gutter.  Arachnoids got 'em."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4064845791" "Watch your step.  That last step is a doozy."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3453421254" "Hostile spotted!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2471516786" "Time to do what we get paid for!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2122093361" "Time to send a fool tumbling into the Gutter!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P68495048" "That one is MINE!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_GUARDCRAB_D3_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1288465273" "Remember your training!  Always look for targets of opportunity!"



// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P387134220" "Break's over.  Back to Patrol."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1190560909" "Stay together."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1487868669" "Eye's open.  Intruders are everywhere."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P87288633" "You shall not stay me from my appointed rounds!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2428271781" "Target acquired!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3512144707" "Take 'em down"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_DOORSMALLPATROL_D3_ALERT_TEXT :
"P956739108" "Oho! Thought you could sneak by, huh?"



// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1338044412" "This stuff is important.  Guard it carefully or Black Scorpion'll have our Heads."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1180001670" "Careful with these crates."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3117272785" "It's not that it's heavy.  Just awkward to get a grip on."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1039370999" "Lift with your legs.  You don't want to throw your back out. <t=4> It's not like we have a health plan or anything."
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3177109187" "This stuff is pretty sensitive.  Handle it with care!"

// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2507763015" "Stash the goods and take care of the interloper!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P863034953" "Watch it!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3668557094" "Take 'em out!"
// GRANDVILLE_GUTTER_CRATEPATROL_D5_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1661633265" "Told you this stuff was precious! Take that fool out!"







// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1848459707" "Wow, this is heavy.  What's in this thing?"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3534375377" "Is this thing filled with rocks or what?"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3886268019" "I work out, but sheez, this is heavy."

// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3010331681" "What are you doing up here?"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3399579326" "You can't be up here!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1177786253" "I don't care who you think you are, you're not allowed up here!"
// GRANDVILLE_THETANGLE_CRATEPATROL_D7_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3219624680" "Fly away.  Shoo."















// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1029744180" "Right.  Put that one over there."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P202616581" "I see we're short a few.  Crey can't share their tech with us, if they don't have anything to use as a sample."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2046662531" "Where's Smith?  I distinctly remember telling him to ensure that all crates were to be stacked and catalogued."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2513352183" "We have three more shipments incoming.  These need to be in place before the next lot arrives."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3249688445" "Careful with those!  That box is worth more than your entire family."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1126016371" "How on earth did you get in here?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P382988248" "Why didn't the turrets take you out!  Nevermind!  I will!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2510177923" "Intruder!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2293891237" "This calls for a particularly subtle blend of psychology and extreme violence."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEMOVE_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3353470929" "We got intruders!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DOORGUARD_CRAB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2830671955" "No admittance!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DOORGUARD_CRAB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2909954221" "You are not authorized to enter!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DOORGUARD_CRAB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P285769448" "Entry permission denied!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DOORGUARD_CRAB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2758259391" "Alert!  Unauthorized personnel!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3119071971" "Our orders are to carry it to the warehouse area with the other set of crates."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P12394753" "A little further."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P544831530" "Sheesh.  What is in this thing?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P676974114" "I don't think I have to remind you guys that dropping these would be a really bad idea."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P577493199" "The technology Crey is passing on to us is sitting in that crate.  Needless to say, if you drop it your life is over."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1203907332" "Demotions don't even begin to describe what will happen to you if you drop that crate."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_ALERT_TEXT :
"P122583793" "This is a secure facility!  How did they get past??"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1793316201" "You are not authorize to be in here!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3663275204" "Alert!  Get them!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3344816341" "What the--?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4104223021" "I'm going to break you in two!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_CRATEPATROL_D10_ALERT_TEXT :
"P418493310" "Trespassing is punishable by death!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P354295209" "Hm.  Looks like things are heating up in Recluse's Victory."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P426746635" "I see Crey's got their PR department on full swing.  Heh.  Heh.  Heh."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3142849902" "Huh.  My stock went down a point."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P919589456" "Nice.  My stock went up a point."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3869561517" "Pocket what?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1057605506" "I'm going to have to check that club out."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P844911334" "You took a WRONG turn, pal!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1288386657" "This is a restricted area!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4210125113" "Leave no trace!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_NEWSPAPER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3779880062" "Excessive force IS recommended!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2866522530" "Remember:  when the pin is pulled, Mr. Grenade is not your friend."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2162958307" "Battle does not determine who is right, it determines who is left."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3823355746" "All I'm saying is if your attack is going really well, it's an ambush."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2242098786" "So he said to me, and I'll never forget this, 'if it's stupid, but it works, it ain't stupid'."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2126122651" "Unauthorized entry!  Leave no trace!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3463250014" "Eliminate them!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1851111967" "Excessive force will be rewarded!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1973295995" "Shoot first, then ask questions!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_TALKER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1835641007" "Don't leave enough for a bodybag!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P796841747" "I'm feeling philosophical."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P925736148" "Hm, this is getting cold."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4053236544" "I need another cup.  Two back-to-back shifts and I'm ready for a cot in a corner."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1582616237" "So he said to me, 'it is generally unadvisable to eject directly over the area you just bombed'."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2557609430" "How did you get in here?!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3195872164" "Some security personnel are about to get fired!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_COFFEE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2894754949" "You just became my new moving target!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2990857075" "Yeah, we're just finishing up down here.  I'll send someone up in a minute."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2920100083" "Yes, sir.  Finish up, we have to get back on shift."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P558084736" "Yes, sir.  We'll be right along.  Hurry up, break's over."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2256993695" "What?  Where?  We'll look into it.  Over and out!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P740241898" "Sir!  I see them!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P999742439" "Got them!  Over and out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1987902104" "Yes, sir!  Over and out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1747056235" "I'm on it!  Over and out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P586556596" "You're in a for a world of hurt!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P194013888" "Don't look conspicuous, it draws fire."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4222570933" "When in doubt, empty your weapon."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2086159669" "If the enemy is in range, so are you."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1081304462" "Eyes alert.  Everything you do can get you shot, including nothing."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2755834292" "Just remember, people, tracers work both ways."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2821479041" "The enemy attacks on two occasions: when he's ready and when you're not."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3768250182" "Attack!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P890471264" "Now!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1828794093" "Let's do this!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_GUARD_D10_WALKIETALKIE_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1692765478" "Don't let them through!"



// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1045315172" "Your job is to check the soil and mantain structure integrity."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1749168497" "Have you not noticed the entire facility is under water?"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3583084044" "Do you want a cave in?  Dig.  Check the structure.  It must hold securely."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3848224868" "All across this island, we have to place structural beams.  We need to keep the underwater construction site safe."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2774685783" "Dig later!  Shoot now!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P17657702" "Shoot now!  Dig later!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2980000247" "Security breach!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2503165405" "They're on the perimeter!  Don't let them get inside!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_DIGGING_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1956450120" "Whatever you do, do NOT let them get inside!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_PATROL_D9_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1196927537" "We have enemy intruders!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_PATROL_D9_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2624638680" "This is what patrol is for, folks!  Let's take them out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_PATROL_D9_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1061574497" "Take them out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_PATROL_D9_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1814274844" "Don't miss!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1689405665" "I just think it's pretty weird that one day we're fighting them and the next they're sharing technology with us."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3071666386" "Hey, so I checked out Pocket D last week.  It was VERY cool.  You should go."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2649001220" "When choosing between two evils, I always try the one I've never tried before."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1218857275" "All I'm saying is, second place is the first loser."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1256304884" "My CO always said, if at first you don't succeed, destroy all evidence that you tried."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3833113806" "Back to work!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1243903944" "Time for some pain!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1142374427" "I love the sound of skulls cracking!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4005406565" "There's nothing quite like the thud of a body hitting the floor!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERA_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3970051453" "You're not authorized to be in here!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3521345864" "Right..."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1479861089" "Interesting..."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P308460292" "Heh heh heh."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3230305851" "You got it."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3777796471" "Too true."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3634685266" "Sure thing."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3607393629" "I'll think about that."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3068743873" "Whoa! Talk later!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3482610463" "Fight now!  Talk later!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3489916517" "Can't talk!  Must fight!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1652373685" "How did you get in here??"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_TALKERB_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4008348672" "YOU again!"



// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_LOITER_D9_COFFEE_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3846153312" "Hold it, this isn't decaf."




// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3923746734" "Poise.  Concentration.  Grace.  It's all in the attitude, ladies."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P322028347" "Very good.  Lovely."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3391093784" "Lovely.  Perfect, ladies."
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3967233040" "Yes, that is how you do it."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1553586977" "Put your training to work!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1671209608" "We will make you suffer!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_D10_LOTUSTRAINING_INSTRUCTOR_ALERT_TEXT :
"P597792971" "The pain you are about to experience will be exquisite."

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2781729131" "Not this time, Corps!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2892491436" "You're going down for the count, Corps!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1687819988" "You're a far way from home, Corps!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3991586702" "You want some of this?  Let's go!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1097458174" "That all you got, Corps?!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3467566691" "You're nothing!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2577631448" "More to the party!  We take all comers!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3144788821" "You want some of Arachnos, too?  Well come on in!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_ARACHNOS_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3365593932" "No one gets in the Fab!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P99025963" "Just shut up and fight!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2137243556" "We never give up!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1712771302" "Stay strong, Corps!  Maintain your fire!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3932129170" "Watch each other's backs, Corps!"

// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1916660419" "Watch out!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1906617167" "We have more!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P987423043" "Check your six!"
// GRANDVILLE_WEBFAB_RANGEDRUMBLE_ARACHNOSLONGBOW_D7_LONGBOW_ALERT_TEXT :
"P970420561" "Check your nine!  More!"





// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGSWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2051921522" "Engaging Search and Destroy pattern Delta"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGSWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P676198618" "Engaging Search and Destroy pattern Gamma"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGSWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1022235073" "Engaging Search and Destroy pattern Alpha"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGSWARM_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P283994213" "Engaging Search and Destroy pattern Beta-12"

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P92085818" "Engaging Patrol pattern Delta"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1467822226" "Engaging Patrol pattern Gamma"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1138678153" "Engaging Patrol pattern Alpha"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1752115984" "Engaging Patrol pattern Beta-12."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P751208888" "Humanoid Anomaly Detected"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2196956055" "Target Acquired."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1965296326" "Target."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3169147239" "Engaging Target."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERLINGPATROL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1992593466" "Target Lock."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3015669504" "We cannot fall behind schedule!  Get them!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3358774580" "The Work must not be stopped!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P804665547" "Recluse'll have our hides! Defend the equipment."

// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2044167309" "So what if you are not lucky enough to be assigned to finishing the Tangle. At least the fall won't kill you here."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1019239198" "Maintenance of the infrastucture of Spider City may not be as glamourous as working on the Tangle superproject, but it is still important."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P221362823" "You'll do what you're told and quit belly-aching. I should report you!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2460054672" "A little too quiet down here today."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4050321865" "Tell you what...  You guys finish before those fellows over in sector 7G and we'll have a pizza party."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2195127421" "Fix those cracks now.  Structural integrity must be maintained or the whole Tangle superstructure'll fall down on us!"
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3559903993" "Patch and move. Patch and move."
// GRANDVILLE_SPIDERCITY_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P547685174" "Look, it's not rocket science.  Not like our project in Warburg."

// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_WELDER_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3266958887" "Hide the circuitry. Someone is snooping."

// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3626358120" "This is an honour to be put on Tangle construction duty."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1756913204" "We have a deadline to meet. If I had a whip, I'd use it.  Now hurry up."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P188763825" " You think I'm driving you hard? Could be a Fortunata overseeing you... They know how to motivate, if you know what I mean. <t=3> And, No... I didn't mean that in the 'good' way."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1041655168" "We've got to get the sensor arrays hooked up before we can call this Project done."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1476973088" "Bonuses to all of us if we meet the schedule! Recluse is very motivated to call the Tangle fully functional."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3206818617" "It's a race against the Germ Warfare division to see who can get their superproject finished first!"
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P298385857" "What's the Tangle for?  You should know not to ask such questions...  it's a loooong way down."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2953422935" "Not sure... but the tangle is most likely NOT an earthquake projector. Maybe 'Weather Control?' "
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P793725665" "Keep building upwards, they say.  Not so sure the buildings can handle much more."
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2981419773" "You are afraid of heights? Boy, did you get the WRONG assignment!"
// GRANDVILLE_TANGLE_WORKCREW_SUPERVISOR_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P625284522" "Careful with your tools.  It's not like Spider City is a hard hat area down there.  You know what kind of velocity a hand scanner has when it reaches the streets down below?"

// NEMESIS_BEACH_BLACK_SCORPION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P190620120" "Hey, you! <em point f=2>Get out there, and take out those drills!"
// NEMESIS_BEACH_BLACK_SCORPION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2445831608" "What are you doing?! Get to work!"
// NEMESIS_BEACH_BLACK_SCORPION_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4131113958" "<em point f=2>Make them suffer!"

// NEMESIS_BEACH_SCIROCCO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2704476573" "What a glorious battle."
// NEMESIS_BEACH_SCIROCCO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1542162952" "I'll keep a watch for anything they may attempt to pull."
// NEMESIS_BEACH_SCIROCCO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1412859487" "Do not bother me, I must concentrate."

// NEMESIS_BEACH_MAKO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1863242591" "It's time to feast!"
// NEMESIS_BEACH_MAKO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1120108007" "I will watch them bleed!"
// NEMESIS_BEACH_MAKO_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P603226828" "I'll tear them all apart, one by one!"

// NEMESIS_BEACH_GHOST_WIDOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P854240890" "You will tell me what Nemesis has planned. Now."
// NEMESIS_BEACH_GHOST_WIDOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P521589985" "It hurts, doesn't it? Now, tell me your mission."
// NEMESIS_BEACH_GHOST_WIDOW_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P159680104" "This wretch has told me of their scheme. You must destroy their drills. You will not be unrewarded for your efforts."

// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3361946083" "According to the data, the materials should be somewhere around here."
// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3618696975" "Right.  This quadrant is almost done.  We'll move over to quadrant 6 in twenty minutes."
// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2733041887" "I'm checking the data and we're in the right quadrant.  Keep digging here."
// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1665972547" "Almost done.  A few more spots in this quadrant and we'll break for lunch."

// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3647859312" "Don't let them access the materials!"
// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2160835206" "Not this time!"
// GRANDVILLE_BEACH_BEACHDIG_CLIPBOARD_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2989521140" "Take care of it!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1019931618" "Secure the area! We must protect the entrance!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P449485924" "Our allies will storm the field. Victory will be ours!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3758228613" "They need to take out the turrets to control the pillboxes. That's IF they can suppress hero resistance."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2627677398" "Stop the heroes!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2806399942" "Call for reinforcements! We must stop them at all costs!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1852487009" "Take the heroes DOWN!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BINOCULAR_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3418026540" "I see nothing, sir."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BINOCULAR_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P262041604" "There's a skirmish in the distance, sir."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BINOCULAR_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P22964909" "The pillbox is under attack, sir. It will soon be ours."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BINOCULAR_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1204463435" "Pockets of activity.  We'll send some patrols over later to break it up."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BINOCULAR_REPORT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P2095209651" "Defend the base!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BINOCULAR_REPORT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1535126806" "How did they get past me?!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_WALKIETALKIE_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P851609508" "Nothing to report, my lord."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_WALKIETALKIE_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3455458287" "We are holding steady. The attacks are going as planned, my lord."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_WALKIETALKIE_REPORT_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P768503334" "Entrance to this dimension is safe, my lord. Your plan will succeed."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_WALKIETALKIE_REPORT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1606056091" "Send reinforcements! We're under attack!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_WALKIETALKIE_REPORT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1723769520" "Secure the portal!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_WALKIETALKIE_REPORT_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3513325926" "Crush them!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FLYING_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1877988696" "Protect."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FLYING_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2432999078" "Follow."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FLYING_PATROL_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P12860270" "Observe."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FLYING_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3233284105" "Crush."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FLYING_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P805921318" "Destroy."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FLYING_PATROL_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P926197309" "Annihilate."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_TARANTULA_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1476393759" "A little closer...and then we will crush them."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_TARANTULA_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P4017773957" "Arachnos will see victory today."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_TARANTULA_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1559155176" "Lord Recluse has made our orders clear.  Chaos and destruction."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_TARANTULA_LOITER_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2583829939" "I see some 'opportunity' coming this way..."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_CRAB_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P828999409" "Crush them! Crush them all!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_CRAB_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3059280944" "Hesitation leads to defeat! Show no mercy!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_CRAB_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1409913637" "You have your orders!  Let's go!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_CRAB_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3480814710" "Show me what you've learned!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_CRAB_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P4039954046" "Make them bleed!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3752900751" "I have forseen victory. We will not fail!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P111567111" "Our leader, Ghost Widow, has called on us. We must not fail her!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3485571394" "Arachnos will be victorious!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1070237104" "Blood will spill this day, I can feel it."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3173784447" "The heroes have no idea how soundly we will crush them."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P881090644" "They are no match for us."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P345667275" "We already knew you were here.  Did you know you were already beaten, though?"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P1016795199" "Destroy the invaders!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3562718527" "Your time for defeat has come."

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P711347872" "Stealth will be the key to victory here."
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P2670936284" "Remember your training. They cannot touch what they cannot see!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3133970577" "The heavies will be well guarded, and the heroes won't realize it until it's too late!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P161237354" "Show them what happens when they cross Arachnos!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P353333002" "Now you see us, now you don't!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3987487909" "Ever wondered what it would be like to fight blind? You're about to find out!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_BANE_LINEUP_ALERTED_TEXT :
"P3230134276" "Make full use of your arsenal!"

// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_CASTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P3990608696" "Keep casting your spells, this will assure our victory!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_CASTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1322380634" "Let us prove that the Fortunatas are not to be trifled with!"
// RECLUSES_VICTORY_FORTUNATA_CASTING_INACTIVE_TEXT :
"P1556062889" "For Arachnos!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1443924409" "Another victim!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P2089498417" "Yesss!  More fodder!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P491089700" "Let's ssstrike!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1322681277" "Interference!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P732591981" "Let'ssss get them!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1652572171" "You'll get no mercy from ussss either!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P3338776939" "Prepare for my fangssss!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P833429416" "You have no idea what I am capable of!"
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLESNAKES_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P3364858466" "For Sstheno!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1371933274" "You can take it from here."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P504916319" "Sure, go ahead and cut in."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P1435430792" "Take over for me. I've got to go see the boss."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2701092997" "Why don't you show them what real trouble feels like."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P3404308933" "I'll get out of your way."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P4008241156" "Sure, you can have a piece of 'em."
// MERCY_DARWIN_RUMBLE_ALL_ALERT_TEXT :
"P2986534304" "Clean up the mess when you're done."

// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P3132742109" "More meat! Let's fight!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1839438274" "My blood's up! We're gonna fight!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1647705990" "Oh, you want some too?"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P16145925" "You just made a huge mistake!"
// MERCY_RUMBLESKULLS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P425497182" "This is going to be easy!"

// MERCY_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P2181741759" "More to kill!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEINFECTED_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P2355338426" "Come closer!"

// MERCY_RUMBLEFREEDOM_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P4055296317" "Lookout! Arachnos are tagging out!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEFREEDOM_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1004943781" "More scumbags incoming!"

// MERCY_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1119802640" "Oh, you scared them away! I'm gonna take you out!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P3354311520" "You interrupted my fun! I'm gonna knock your head off!"
// MERCY_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P3215065307" "Didn't your mother ever tell you not to play with fire?"
// MERCY_RUMBLEHELLIONS_ALERT2_TEXT :
"P1263518286" "I've been itchin' for a good fight."

// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_GUARD :
"P3742674209" "Discipline won this fight! The Freedom Corps is weak! We are strong! We train to fight!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_INTERROGATION :
"P42789713" "Your friends have abandoned you! Further resistance is folly. Give us the codes!"

// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_DEAD1 :
"P125578254" "Time to take out the trash."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_DEAD1 :
"P2613719842" "Just throw 'em over the side. Feed the fish."

// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_DEAD2 :
"P3339118364" "Can't you dig any faster?"

// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_WATCH1 :
"P213188098" "We've got this covered."
// MERCY_DARWIN_PHASED_ARACHNOS_WATCH1 :
"P1334027853" "Justice in action."

